window.LD=window.LD||{};window.LD["replays"]={"rows":[{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Saltmarrow","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"There is a road where there was a field yesterday. It runs due west and has milestones that count backwards. Joshua walks it, and arrives somewhere known and strange.","k":"road","id":"r178","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":4,"score":40},{"t":"Met Jory Bellwether","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Ironhaven","h":["h18"],"x":"'Oyez!' says Jory Bellwether to Morgan, and tells the road a piece of news about the Wolf Den that Morgan very much wanted to hear.","k":"road","id":"r171","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Met Pim","at":"the road between Frostspire and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h12"],"x":"Pim is peering into a hole in the hedge when Juni comes up for the first time, and says he is looking for a good place to rise.","k":"road","id":"r174","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Harry vs a Cave Troll","r":"won","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h1"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f114","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"It takes Harry 7 rounds to squeak past a Cave Troll in the troll's hollow on the bottom floor of Cragtooth Warren. The cave troll stood smiling at Harry for a whole round. Poker Face. Loot: 33…"},{"t":"Stolen-Sausage Hotpot","at":"the Veldrock feast-day tables","h":["h7","h17"],"x":"The Veldrock cook has turned the season's sold parts into Stolen-Sausage Hotpot, and Corrine and Amanda eat it with the pride of suppliers. It is all the sweeter for being stolen twice. (8 copper…","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m102","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Wraith-Chill Sorbet","at":"the Frosthold feast-day tables","h":["h8"],"x":"The Frosthold cook serves Wraith-Chill Sorbet on feast day, made from what heroes sold her, and Troy recognises some of it. It has a breath of the crypt in it that nobody mentions. (8 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m100","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Wraith-Chill Sorbet","at":"the Frosthold feast-day tables","h":["h5"],"x":"The Frosthold cook serves Wraith-Chill Sorbet on feast day, made from what heroes sold her, and Griffin recognises some of it. It frosts the spoon on the way in. (8 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m101","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Wraith-Chill Sorbet","at":"the Frosthold feast-day tables","h":["h4","h16"],"x":"The Frosthold cook has turned the season's sold parts into Wraith-Chill Sorbet, and Allie and Katie eat it with the pride of suppliers. It has a breath of the crypt in it that nobody mentions. (8…","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m103","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Kobold Peppercorn Stew","h":["h13","h11","h2"],"x":"At The Honest Toll, Cade, Joshua and Andrew split some Kobold Peppercorn Stew several ways and argue happily over the last of it. It has one firepepper in it, which is one too many. (2 silver 1…","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m104","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"\"The Gravedigger's Roll-Call\" by the fire","at":"camp in Cragtooth Warren","h":["h3"],"x":"Ryan sings \"The Gravedigger's Roll-Call\" low, and the dark past the firelight seems to come a step closer to listen. Pickles lies down with its chin on its paws and doesn't move till the last note.","tag":"song","k":"night","id":"n58","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Chess: Katie v Allie","at":"The Third Coat","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"On move 30, Katie hangs the queen. Allie tries not to smile, and fails. Being a queen down by move 31 is enough for Katie, who tips the king to Allie.","tag":"chess","k":"night","id":"n59","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Cards for Corrine, read by Widow Cinder","at":"a cottage by the pithead","h":["h7"],"x":"Corrine sits down across from Widow Cinder at a cottage by the pithead. Three cards: the Five of Swords, the Fool and the Ace of Swords. Half a blessing and half a warning.","k":"reading","id":"r169","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Garrow's Span","at":"the road between Frosthold and Veldrock","h":["h17","h5","h7","h8"],"x":"Corrine wades the freezing river below Garrow's Span to avoid the toll and spends an hour afterwards hugging a fire.","k":"road","id":"r168","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Four Stones","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Ironhaven","h":["h18"],"x":"Morgan adds a pebble to the pile at the Four Stones, as the custom runs, and the pile grows by one.","k":"road","id":"r170","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Pitmen's Rest","at":"the road between Emberdeep and Veldrock","h":["h15"],"x":"A shift of miners sleeps in a row on the Pitmen's Rest benches, black to the eyebrows, and Matt steps quietly over a boot as long as his arm.","k":"road","id":"r172","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Pitmen's Rest","at":"the road between Emberdeep and Veldrock","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt reads the names scratched into the beams of the Pitmen's Rest by fifty years of miners, and finds one that makes him laugh.","k":"road","id":"r173","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Snow Lamp","at":"the road between Frostspire and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h12"],"x":"Juni drops 1 copper in the tin at the Snow Lamp and trims the wick, as every traveller on the pass is asked to.","k":"road","id":"r175","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Frostspire and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h12"],"x":"On a moonlit field by the road to Frostspire Juni comes on a ring of hares, dozens, sitting still in a perfect circle. Juni stands there until the hares go, and the moon with them.","k":"road","id":"r176","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Saltmarrow","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"A small child holds a rope across the road to Carrbridge and demands a toll of one pebble. Keenan hands over a good grey stone, solemnly. The child inspects it and lowers the rope with ceremony.","k":"road","id":"r177","d":46,"s":2,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"The Pack of Carrbridge vs 3 Ice Wraiths","r":"lost","at":"Whitepeak Pass","h":["h4","h16"],"tag":"road","k":"fight","id":"f113","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"A rough road to Whitepeak Pass: 3 Ice Wraiths rout the Pack of Carrbridge. Allie was the last one out and the angriest about it. \"Nobody left behind. That's what counts,\" says Allie. Injured: Allie…"},{"t":"Met the Off-Key Collective","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Saltmarrow","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"Fenella Stray shares a best trick for holding a note with Cade, and Cade finds his own voice a little less shaky afterward.","k":"road","id":"r166","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Fireside Flatbread","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia tries a Fireside Flatbread in Cragtooth Warren. It goes wrong in a way nobody can quite explain, and everyone is a little unwell by morning.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m98","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Silver Roach, 16 cm","at":"by a stream on the road to Carrbridge","h":["h9","h13","h11","h2"],"x":"Keenan and Cade share a flask by a stream on the road to Carrbridge, a quiet hour, and a silver roach that nobody will admit was luck.","k":"catch","id":"c43","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Not a fish","at":"the tarn on Whitepeak Pass","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Katie hauls up a kettle at the tarn on Whitepeak Pass, and decides it was probably someone's treasure once.","k":"catch","id":"c44","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Wolf Stew","at":"the Frosthold feast-day tables","h":["h17","h8","h5","h7"],"x":"Feast day in Frosthold: the cook has made Wolf Stew from the parts heroes sold here this season, and Amanda, Troy, Griffin and Corrine get the first bowls. It is wolf, which nobody mentions to the…","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m93","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Snowdrift Pudding","h":["h17"],"x":"Amanda elbows through the market-day crowd in Frosthold and comes out holding some Snowdrift Pudding. It has to be eaten before it notices it's indoors. (1 silver 2 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m94","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"The Clifftop Clatter","h":["h7"],"x":"A cart from Saltmarrow has come for market day in Frosthold, selling The Clifftop Clatter. Corrine buys one to see what the fuss is. It gets cracked open with the back of a shield. (2 silver 1 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m95","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Wolf Stew","at":"the Frosthold feast-day tables","h":["h16"],"x":"Feast day in Frosthold: the cook has made Wolf Stew from the parts heroes sold here this season, and Katie gets the first bowl. It is wolf, which nobody mentions to the horses. (8 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m96","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Varro Brothers' Spiced Bun","at":"judging the Ironhaven cooks' feud","h":["h10"],"x":"Olivia tastes a Varro Brothers' Spiced Bun from Aldo Varro, then from Benno Varro, then from Aldo Varro again to be sure, and names Aldo Varro the better. The other one takes it badly. (6 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m97","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Skillet Berry Cobbler","at":"Whitepeak Pass","h":["h12"],"x":"Nobody to impress in Whitepeak Pass, so Juni makes some Skillet Berry Cobbler exactly the way Juni likes it. It has purple juice bubbling up through the crust.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m99","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Checkers: Corrine v Amanda","at":"The Third Coat","h":["h7","h17"],"x":"Corrine corners Amanda's last piece and says gently that it was a good game. Corrine and Amanda start a checkers record tonight, and both swear it will be short.","tag":"checkers","k":"night","id":"n57","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Last Stove","at":"the road between Frosthold and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Hild Aaskov pours something steaming for Katie at the Last Stove and slides a fresh rumour across the counter along with it.","k":"road","id":"r161","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Reed and Rooster","at":"the road between Bleakmarsh and Carrbridge","h":["h18"],"x":"Morgan stops at the Reed and Rooster's door, where something is simmering and Widow Orla Brack has strict opinions about it.","k":"road","id":"r162","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Frosthold and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h12"],"x":"A crow on a gatepost beside the road to Whitepeak Pass says Juni's name, then a rumour about Emberdeep, then caws like a crow. Juni is not sure which part was real.","k":"road","id":"r163","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Last Stove","at":"the road between Frosthold and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h12"],"x":"Juni stops at the Last Stove, thaws her fingers on the great iron stove, and reads the board while Hild Aaskov pours.","k":"road","id":"r164","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Cinder Cup","at":"the road between Emberdeep and Veldrock","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt sits among the miners at the Cinder Cup while a hundred verses of 'The Lamp Is Out' go round, each worse than the last.","k":"road","id":"r165","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Last Dry Sock","at":"the road between Cragtooth Warren and Ironhaven","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Sergeant Ivo Ottoway puts the guests of the Last Dry Sock through a morning drill in the yard, and Mark is made to stand at the front and demonstrate a lunge.","k":"road","id":"r167","d":45,"s":2,"sd":15,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"\"The Troll Counts Its Supper\" by the fire","at":"camp by the road to Carrbridge","h":["h13","h2","h9","h11"],"x":"Cade saws into \"The Troll Counts Its Supper\" on the Saltmarrow Shanty Fiddle, and the bow seems to pull the whole camp along behind it. Socks leans against the singer's leg for the whole song.","tag":"song","k":"night","id":"n55","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Cards for Joshua, read by Auntie Gull","at":"the net lofts","h":["h11"],"x":"Auntie Gull reads for Joshua at the net lofts and takes a long look at each card: the Empress, the Seven of Wands and the Ten of Cups. The cards are kind.","k":"reading","id":"r153","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Saltmarrow","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"Cade finds an abandoned caravan beside the road to Carrbridge, wheels sunk, wagons empty save for a chest wedged under a seat with 15 silver in it.","k":"road","id":"r155","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Cards for Andrew, read by Auntie Gull","at":"the net lofts","h":["h2"],"x":"Auntie Gull lays three cards out for Andrew at the net lofts: the Page of Cups, the Two of Pentacles and the Six of Cups. Auntie Gull calls it a lucky spread, and means it.","k":"reading","id":"r154","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Stolen from the bank","at":"on the ice on Frosthold lake","h":["h7"],"x":"Corrine lands a burbot on the ice on Frosthold lake, and Moose takes it off the bank before it has finished flapping.","k":"catch","id":"c42","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Forge-Bellows Pepper Pot","h":["h14"],"x":"Mark orders a Forge-Bellows Pepper Pot at The Gilded Flagon. It has a ladle that has never been to the bottom. (2 silver 2 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m88","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Smoked Ice-Lake Salmon","h":["h4"],"x":"Big Inga has written Smoked Ice-Lake Salmon on the board at The Third Coat in letters a foot high: dish of the week. Allie orders it before sitting down. It is sliced thin enough to read through. (2…","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m89","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Wraith-Chill Sorbet","h":["h17"],"x":"Big Inga remembers Amanda's tastes and sets down some Wraith-Chill Sorbet at The Third Coat without being asked. Her favourite kind of thing. (2 silver 7 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m90","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Frost-Elk Stew","h":["h5"],"x":"Griffin has some Frost-Elk Stew at The Third Coat and asks Big Inga for the recipe. His favourite kind of thing. (1 silver 8 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m91","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Frost-Elk Stew","h":["h7"],"x":"Corrine orders some Frost-Elk Stew at The Third Coat. It steams the eyebrows, kindly. (1 silver 8 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m92","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Checkers: Troy v Griffin","at":"The Third Coat","h":["h8","h5"],"x":"Griffin resigns with a bow, a sigh and a promise. Record opened: Troy against Griffin, at checkers, with a long road ahead.","tag":"checkers","k":"night","id":"n56","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Cards for Ryan, read by Sabine Venn","at":"the toll-house parlour","h":["h3"],"x":"Sabine Venn shuffles twice, cuts once, and deals Ryan three cards: the Ten of Swords, the Hanged Man and the Queen of Cups. The spread can't make up its mind, and neither can Sabine Venn.","k":"reading","id":"r150","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Cards for Troy, read by Grandmother Skaldi","at":"a hut on the edge of the snowfield","h":["h8"],"x":"At a hut on the edge of the snowfield, Grandmother Skaldi turns Troy's three cards one at a time: the Seven of Pentacles, the Five of Wands upside down and the Eight of Pentacles. Even the candle…","k":"reading","id":"r159","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Cards for Griffin, read by Grandmother Skaldi","at":"a hut on the edge of the snowfield","h":["h5"],"x":"Grandmother Skaldi lays three cards out for Griffin at a hut on the edge of the snowfield: the Page of Cups, Judgement and the Five of Swords. Some good, some not.","k":"reading","id":"r160","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Scratched Stone","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Ironhaven","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia finds a clear patch low on the Scratched Stone and carves her name there for the league to see.","k":"road","id":"r151","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Hunting in Bleakmarsh","at":"Bleakmarsh","h":["h18"],"x":"Morgan saves the scraps for tomorrow's broth. A fox watches from the dark and gets nothing. It is a fair world, in its way.","tag":"hunt","k":"road","id":"r152","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Frosthold and Veldrock","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt waves down a passing peddler on the road to Veldrock and swaps news for a good-natured nod.","k":"road","id":"r156","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Garrow's Span","at":"the road between Frosthold and Veldrock","h":["h12"],"x":"Juni hangs a line off Garrow's Span and catches nothing, and Old Garrow says nothing has been caught here since the old queen's day.","k":"road","id":"r157","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Frosthold and Ironhaven","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"A long, quiet afternoon at the river leaves Katie and Allie sunburnt, hungry and in no hurry to leave the bank.","k":"road","id":"r158","d":44,"s":2,"sd":14,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"The Bog King got away","at":"the Bleakmarsh channels","h":["h18"],"x":"People will not believe Morgan at the Bleakmarsh channels, and Morgan does not blame them. The Bog King took the bait, and then took the line. By now the story has it as long as an oar.","k":"catch","id":"c41","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Met the Gilded Thimble Players","at":"the road between Ashfen and Carrbridge","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Master Hobbs Vellum watches Ryan cross a stream and murmurs that it will fit nicely into Act Two.","k":"road","id":"r148","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Snow Whitefish, 55 cm","at":"on the ice on Frosthold lake","h":["h7"],"x":"Corrine lands a snow whitefish on the ice on Frosthold lake, the first the league has ever seen. The anglers will want to hear about it.","k":"catch","id":"c38","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Sea Bass, 68 cm","at":"the Saltmarrow harbour wall","h":["h9"],"x":"Keenan adds a new name to the league's catch book at the Saltmarrow harbour wall: Sea Bass, 68 cm, never taken before.","k":"catch","id":"c40","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Matt vs a Frost Imp","r":"won","at":"Whitepeak Pass","h":["h15"],"tag":"road","k":"fight","id":"f112","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"On the road to Veldrock, where a rider made of rime and a pack of white wolves come out of the snow, a Frost Imp gets in Matt's way, briefly. The other side was doing fine right up until Matt's…"},{"t":"Arctic Char, 24 cm","at":"the Frozen Ladle","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Katie reels in an arctic char at the Frozen Ladle, 24 cm of cheerful wriggling.","k":"catch","id":"c39","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Rat-on-a-Stick","h":["h8"],"x":"Big Inga talks Troy into a Rat-on-a-Stick at The Third Coat. Good advice: it comes glazed and somehow dignified. (1 silver 5 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m84","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Rat-on-a-Stick","h":["h7"],"x":"Corrine has a Rat-on-a-Stick at The Third Coat and sends compliments to Big Inga. It is better than it has any right to be. (1 silver 5 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m85","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Stolen-Sausage Hotpot","at":"the Carrbridge feast-day tables","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia, Mark and Ryan find Stolen-Sausage Hotpot on the Carrbridge feast-day tables, made from the parts sold in town this season, and wonder which bits were theirs. It is the bandits' own beans,…","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m86","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Stolen-Sausage Hotpot","at":"by the road to Frosthold","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Katie makes some Stolen-Sausage Hotpot by the road to Frosthold and nobody talks while it's eaten. It is the bandits' own beans, which feels right.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m87","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Cards: Ryan v Mark","at":"The Honest Toll","h":["h3","h14"],"x":"Ryan slaps the first card down so hard that the soup jumps. Ryan sweeps up the cards, tidy as a clerk, and Mark sighs a long sigh. A record begins this evening between Ryan and Mark, with the…","tag":"cards","k":"night","id":"n53","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Checkers: Joshua v Keenan","at":"The Drowned Gull","h":["h11","h9"],"x":"A slow game of checkers begins, with long thoughts and short remarks. Keenan takes the game and helps Joshua pick up the captured pieces afterwards. That was the first game of checkers between…","tag":"checkers","k":"night","id":"n54","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Garrow's Span","at":"the road between Frosthold and Veldrock","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt drops 3 copper in the box at Garrow's Span, and Old Garrow tells the story of the second collapse, with gestures.","k":"road","id":"r144","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Frozen Ladle","at":"the road between Frosthold and Ironhaven","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Katie is dragged onto the lake by the Frozen Ladle's children, falls spectacularly three times, and wins applause for the third.","k":"road","id":"r145","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between The Salt Cliffs and Saltmarrow","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"A child sits across the road to Saltmarrow on a stool with a stick for a bar: 'Answer my riddle or pay.' Keenan answers it, and gets a gingerbread man and a salute.","k":"road","id":"r146","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Gannet ferry","at":"the road between The Salt Cliffs and Saltmarrow","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"Keenan hands over 2 copper at the Gannet ferry and perches on a crate of nets that smells of every tide.","k":"road","id":"r147","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Ashfen ferry","at":"the road between Ashfen and Carrbridge","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Between crossings, the ferry hands at the Ashfen ferry trail lines off the stern. Mark is shown how it is done and given the tail end of the day's chatter for free.","k":"road","id":"r149","d":43,"s":2,"sd":13,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"The Bog King got away","at":"the Bleakmarsh channels","h":["h18"],"x":"The Bog King surfaces at the Bleakmarsh channels, looks at Morgan for one long second, and goes down with the hook, the float, and half the line.","k":"catch","id":"c37","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Met Pim","at":"the road between Frosthold and Ironhaven","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Katie accepts Pim's offer to haul the pack for a day. It is a lot lighter, in every sense.","k":"road","id":"r134","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Met Tansy Fell","at":"the road between Ashfen and Carrbridge","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Over the fire Tansy Fell lets slip that the rats around Frostspire have been unusually bold, which interests Ryan a great deal.","k":"road","id":"r139","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Pike, 71 cm","at":"by a stream on the road to Carrbridge","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia lands a pike by a stream on the road to Carrbridge, the first the league has ever seen. The anglers will want to hear about it.","k":"catch","id":"c35","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Mackerel, 30 cm","at":"the foot of the Salt Cliffs","h":["h9","h13","h11","h2"],"x":"A first for the whole league: Keenan pulls a mackerel at the foot of the Salt Cliffs and holds it up as proof.","k":"catch","id":"c36","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"The Pack of Carrbridge vs a Hobgoblin and a Bridge Troll","r":"won","at":"The King's Road","h":["h4","h16"],"tag":"camp","k":"fight","id":"f109","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"In the middle of the night, a Hobgoblin and a Bridge Troll find the Pack of Carrbridge's camp on the road to Frosthold, and the Pack of Carrbridge dispatches them. Allie's Endless Winter hit the…"},{"t":"Matt vs a Frost Wolf","r":"won","at":"Whitepeak Pass","h":["h15"],"tag":"road","k":"fight","id":"f111","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"Win number four in a row: Matt dispatches a Frost Wolf out in the frozen dark beyond Frosthold, where the frost giant's outriders come down out of the hills. Matt had the final say, by way of Hammer…"},{"t":"Nothing bit","at":"Garrow's Span","h":["h17","h5","h7","h8"],"x":"It is a lovely day to catch nothing at Garrow's Span, and Amanda manages it beautifully.","k":"catch","id":"c32","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Stolen from the bank","at":"on the ice on Frosthold lake","h":["h17"],"x":"The catch is on the bank for less than a minute on the ice on Frosthold lake before a fox gets it. Amanda salutes the professional.","k":"catch","id":"c33","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Nothing bit","at":"on the ice on Frosthold lake","h":["h7"],"x":"Not a nibble on the ice on Frosthold lake. Corrine decides the fish are on a day off.","k":"catch","id":"c34","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Harry vs a Kobold and a Giant Bat","r":"won","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h1"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f110","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10,"x":"In a chute with chewed footholds on the first floor of Cragtooth Warren, a Kobold and a Giant Bat get in Harry's way, briefly. Harry's Arc Lightning closed the matter with a crackle. Loot: 4 silver,…"},{"t":"Varro Brothers' Spiced Bun","h":["h16"],"x":"Katie hands over 6 copper in Ironhaven and gets a Varro Brothers' Spiced Bun in return. A fair trade. It leaves sugar on everything for the rest of the day.","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m81","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Yeti-Bun","at":"judging the Frosthold cooks' feud","h":["h8"],"x":"The Yeti Society kitchen and Baker Ulfa have argued about what really goes into a yeti-bun for years. In Frosthold, Troy is handed a spoon by each and told to settle it. Troy picks the Yeti Society…","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m82","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Yeti-Bun","h":["h5"],"x":"Yeti-Bun, eaten on a Frosthold doorstep by Griffin, who refuses to share. It is so soft it sighs when you bite it. (6 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m83","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"\"Allie, Allie, Bring the Silver Home\" by the fire","at":"camp by the road to Frosthold","h":["h4"],"x":"Allie sings \"Allie, Allie, Bring the Silver Home\" while the pot finishes, and it might be the best part of supper. Pepper howls along on the chorus, a beat behind and very proud of it.","tag":"song","k":"night","id":"n52","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Cards for Amanda, read by Widow Cinder","at":"a cottage by the pithead","h":["h17"],"x":"Amanda crosses Widow Cinder's palm with copper at a cottage by the pithead, and three cards come up: the Tower, the Four of Pentacles and the Five of Cups upside down. Widow Cinder turns the last…","k":"reading","id":"r137","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Cards for Matt, read by Grandmother Skaldi","at":"a hut on the edge of the snowfield","h":["h15"],"x":"At a hut on the edge of the snowfield, Grandmother Skaldi turns Matt's three cards one at a time: the King of Pentacles, the Four of Wands and the Four of Pentacles. Grandmother Skaldi hums over the…","k":"reading","id":"r142","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between The Salt Cliffs and The Sunken Vault","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"Andrew dares the band to wash in a freezing stream by the road to the Salt Cliffs, and Joshua accepts first. The shriek travels for miles, and everyone's mood is bright afterward.","k":"road","id":"r135","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the wreckers' false light","at":"the road between The Salt Cliffs and The Sunken Vault","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"The door of the wreckers' false light is scratched with the names of ships that never came home, and Keenan reads them all out loud, slowly.","k":"road","id":"r136","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Garrow's Span","at":"the road between Frosthold and Veldrock","h":["h17","h5","h7","h8"],"x":"The planks of Garrow's Span glaze over at dawn, and Troy crosses on hands and knees, to the lasting joy of Old Garrow.","k":"road","id":"r138","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Last Stove","at":"the road between Frosthold and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h15"],"x":"The great stove at the Last Stove roars, and Matt presses against it until the shivering stops and the steam starts.","k":"road","id":"r140","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Whitepeak Cairn","at":"the road between Frosthold and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h15"],"x":"A child's blue pebble sits near the top of the Whitepeak Cairn, and Matt wonders who carried it up and why.","k":"road","id":"r141","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Drowned Lantern","at":"the road between Ashfen and Bleakmarsh","h":["h18"],"x":"Mudge Alderwick sells Morgan a whole Eel Pie for 1 silver, and swears the eel died of old age.","k":"road","id":"r143","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Knucklebones: won 690 silver","at":"Frosthold","h":["h15"],"tag":"table","k":"table","id":"g15","d":42,"s":2,"sd":12,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Met Lady Perpetua Vane","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Ironhaven","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Allie follows Lady Perpetua Vane down the wrong road for half a day, because it would be rude not to.","k":"road","id":"r130","d":41,"s":2,"sd":11,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Harry vs 3 Kobolds","r":"won","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h1"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f106","d":41,"s":2,"sd":11,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"Harry runs into 3 Kobolds in the chief's hall on the first floor of Cragtooth Warren and comes out on top. Harry cast Arc Lightning into the middle of them, and two kobolds didn't get up. Loot: 21…"},{"t":"The Black Pack vs 4 Wolves","r":"won","at":"The King's Road","h":["h14","h3","h10"],"tag":"road","k":"fight","id":"f107","d":41,"s":2,"sd":11,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"On the road to Ashfen, the Black Pack squares up to 4 Wolves and carries the day. The last wolf bolts. Olivia kept two of them busy so nobody else had to. Loot: 3 pelts, a wolf haunch."},{"t":"Tidal Riders vs 4 Frost Wolves","r":"won","at":"Whitepeak Pass","h":["h17","h8","h5","h7"],"tag":"road","k":"fight","id":"f108","d":41,"s":2,"sd":11,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"Riding a good week, Tidal Riders defeat 4 Frost Wolves on the road to Veldrock, where the frost giant's outriders are waiting in the drifts. Griffin's Twin Strike finished the fight. It was…"},{"t":"Cards for Allie, read by Magister Quillon","at":"the Academy library","h":["h4"],"x":"Allie crosses Magister Quillon's palm with copper at the Academy library, and three cards come up: the Two of Cups, the Knight of Swords and the Hermit. A spread to sleep well on.","k":"reading","id":"r132","d":41,"s":2,"sd":11,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"the Snow Lamp","at":"the road between Frostspire and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt pays 2 copper for a fresh jar of oil at the Snow Lamp and fills it to the lip, and the flame seems to lean toward him.","k":"road","id":"r127","d":41,"s":2,"sd":11,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Nothing bit","at":"the Ashfen dyke","h":["h18"],"x":"Morgan sits at the Ashfen dyke for an hour and catches a good view.","k":"catch","id":"c30","d":41,"s":2,"sd":11,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Brown Trout, 41 cm","at":"by a stream outside The Sunken Vault","h":["h9","h13","h11","h2"],"x":"Brown Trout of 41 cm! Keenan stands by a stream outside the Sunken Vault holding it and looks for someone to tell.","k":"catch","id":"c31","d":41,"s":2,"sd":11,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Sea-Grape Salad","h":["h3"],"x":"Ryan orders some Sea-Grape Salad at The Damp Lantern. It pops like tiny bells and hums if you listen. (2 silver 4 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m79","d":41,"s":2,"sd":11,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Forge-Bellows Pepper Pot","h":["h16"],"x":"Forge-Bellows Pepper Pot at The Gilded Flagon: Katie goes quiet and happy. Her favourite kind of thing. (2 silver 2 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m80","d":41,"s":2,"sd":11,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Cards for Katie, read by Magister Quillon","at":"the Academy library","h":["h16"],"x":"Magister Quillon reads for Katie at the Academy library and takes a long look at each card: the Hierophant upside down, the Fool upside down and the Seven of Cups. Magister Quillon offers to read…","k":"reading","id":"r133","d":41,"s":2,"sd":11,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between The Collapsed Mine and Veldrock","h":["h12"],"x":"Juni argues with a man in a troll costume on the road to Veldrock about whether trolls have a licence to collect. The man has the better case.","k":"road","id":"r128","d":41,"s":2,"sd":11,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Shrine of Quiet Names","at":"the road between Ashfen and The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Ryan pays 1 copper at the Shrine of Quiet Names, where a bunch of wilted flowers lies on the step with a short note.","k":"road","id":"r129","d":41,"s":2,"sd":11,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Four Stones","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Ironhaven","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Katie takes the main road at the Four Stones and a carter shares a pear.","k":"road","id":"r131","d":41,"s":2,"sd":11,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Tidal Riders vs Juni","r":"won","at":"The Collapsed Mine","h":["h17","h8","h5","h7","h12"],"k":"fight","id":"f104","d":40,"s":2,"sd":10,"imp":5,"score":65,"x":"Old scores get settled outside the Collapsed Mine, where Tidal Riders flatten Juni."},{"t":"The Legend's Feast","at":"the Collapsed Mine","h":["h7","h17","h8","h5"],"x":"Corrine cooks the spoils in the Collapsed Mine: The Legend's Feast. Somebody cries a little and blames the smoke. It is the biggest thing the camp has ever cooked. It was The Lamp-Eater, landed by…","tag":"legendary","k":"meal","id":"m78","d":40,"s":2,"sd":10,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Met Mags Halloran","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Ironhaven","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Allie learns more about tracking in an hour with Mags Halloran than in a year of guessing.","k":"road","id":"r120","d":40,"s":2,"sd":10,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Met Ines","at":"the road between Ashfen and The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h18"],"x":"Morgan is surprised to find a ridge on Ines's map marked with her own name. She has been drawing it all week.","k":"road","id":"r122","d":40,"s":2,"sd":10,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"The Pack of Carrbridge vs a Frost Wolf and a Frost Imp","r":"won","at":"Bleakmarsh","h":["h4","h16"],"tag":"road","k":"fight","id":"f105","d":40,"s":2,"sd":10,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"A Frost Wolf and a Frost Imp fall to the Pack of Carrbridge past the Carrbridge gate in the dark, where the frost on the hedges stands up and turns out to be the frost giant's outriders. Allie wove…"},{"t":"Eel Pie","at":"the Ashfen feast-day tables","h":["h18"],"x":"Morgan squeezes onto the end of an Ashfen feast-day bench for an Eel Pie. It has eels looking up out of the crust with polite interest. (8 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m76","d":40,"s":2,"sd":10,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Stolen from the bank","at":"the antechamber pool of the Sunken Vault","h":["h9","h13","h11","h2"],"x":"Keenan has a pale loach for exactly as long as it takes a pale crab to look up at the antechamber pool of the Sunken Vault.","k":"catch","id":"c29","d":40,"s":2,"sd":10,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Fried River Fish in a Paper Cone","h":["h16"],"x":"Fried River Fish in a Paper Cone is chalked up as the dish of the week at The Honest Toll, and Katie is first to try it. It comes in a cone of somebody's unpaid toll notice. (8 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m74","d":40,"s":2,"sd":10,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Kelp-Battered Cod","h":["h18"],"x":"The market in Ashfen has a cook up from Saltmarrow today. Morgan queues for some Kelp-Battered Cod on the strength of the smell alone. It smells of the harbour on a good day. (1 silver 2 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m75","d":40,"s":2,"sd":10,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Slime Jelly","at":"the Sunken Vault","h":["h11","h9","h13","h2"],"x":"Joshua makes some Slime Jelly in the Sunken Vault, and Keenan has seconds before anyone else has firsts. Keenan's favourite kind of thing: it slides a little towards whoever looks hungriest.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m77","d":40,"s":2,"sd":10,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Four Stones","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Ironhaven","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Katie reaches the Four Stones, a crossroads marked by four grey pillars. A heap of pebbles rises at the foot of each.","k":"road","id":"r121","d":40,"s":2,"sd":10,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Shrine of Quiet Names","at":"the road between Ashfen and The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h18"],"x":"Morgan drops 1 copper in the dish at the Shrine of Quiet Names and finds the wax already warm from the last taper.","k":"road","id":"r123","d":40,"s":2,"sd":10,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Met Sergeant Hobb Withy","at":"the road between The Collapsed Mine and Veldrock","h":["h12"],"x":"Sergeant Hobb Withy puts Juni through a roadside drill: stand, turn, kneel, rise. Juni comes out of it standing straighter, and humbled.","k":"road","id":"r124","d":40,"s":2,"sd":10,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Pickaxe Rest","at":"the road between The Collapsed Mine and Veldrock","h":["h12"],"x":"Juni passes the Pickaxe Rest, where the tankards hang from the beams on pegs, and each has a name scratched in.","k":"road","id":"r125","d":40,"s":2,"sd":10,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Last Dry Sock","at":"the road between Cragtooth Warren and Ironhaven","h":["h1"],"x":"Harry reads the rumour wall of the Last Dry Sock while Sergeant Ivo Ottoway stamps a ticket for each reader. The freshest scrap speaks of Emberdeep.","k":"road","id":"r126","d":40,"s":2,"sd":10,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"The Lamp-Eater, landed","at":"the flooded gallery of the Collapsed Mine","h":["h7","h17","h8","h5"],"x":"The Lamp-Eater comes in at the flooded gallery of the Collapsed Mine like a drowned barn door. 140 cm. Corrine sits beside it and cannot speak.","k":"catch","id":"c28","d":39,"s":2,"sd":9,"imp":4,"score":40},{"t":"Matt vs an Ice Wraith and an Ice Golem","r":"won","at":"Frostspire","h":["h15"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f102","d":39,"s":2,"sd":9,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"It takes Matt 6 rounds to outlast an Ice Wraith and an Ice Golem in the frozen guardroom on the first floor of Frostspire. Matt found the ice golem with Power Strike and nearly split it in two.…"},{"t":"The Royal Shadows vs 4 Drowned","r":"won","at":"The Sunken Vault","h":["h9","h13","h11","h2"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f103","d":39,"s":2,"sd":9,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"The Royal Shadows, in fine spirits lately, cut down 4 Drowned in the counting-house on the first floor of the Sunken Vault. The Drowned spent the rest of the fight on fire, courtesy of Keenan's…"},{"t":"Forge-Bellows Pepper Pot","h":["h4"],"x":"Forge-Bellows Pepper Pot is chalked up as the dish of the week at The Gilded Flagon, and Allie is first to try it. It is hot enough to make the smiths at the next table respectful. (2 silver 2 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m72","d":39,"s":2,"sd":9,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Cards: Allie v Bandit","at":"the road to Ironhaven","h":["h4"],"x":"The bandit would really rather not fight today. It would rather play Crooked Cards, and it has already picked Allie. Allie loses, and the bandit holds out both hands for a gem, which the crew drops…","tag":"cards","k":"night","id":"n50","d":39,"s":2,"sd":9,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Tidal Riders vs a Cave Troll","r":"won","at":"The Collapsed Mine","h":["h17","h8","h5","h7"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f101","d":39,"s":2,"sd":9,"imp":1,"score":10,"x":"Griffin takes the worst of it as Tidal Riders make short work of a Cave Troll in the troll's larder on the bottom floor of the Collapsed Mine. Amanda had the final say, by way of Drain Life. Griffin…"},{"t":"Ration-Bag Hash","at":"the Collapsed Mine","h":["h7","h17","h8","h5"],"x":"Corrine serves some Ration-Bag Hash in the Collapsed Mine, and Troy closes his eyes on the first mouthful. A favourite. It crisps at the edges where the skillet was hottest.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m71","d":39,"s":2,"sd":9,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Hammerhand Mixed Grill","h":["h16"],"x":"Hammerhand Mixed Grill at The Gilded Flagon: Katie cleans the plate. It comes on a shield with a dent in it that has a story. (3 silver 5 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m73","d":39,"s":2,"sd":9,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"\"The Hollow Tree\" by the fire","at":"camp in The Sunken Vault","h":["h13","h11","h2"],"x":"Cade sings \"The Hollow Tree\" in a spooky voice that is more goose than ghost. Joshua and Andrew scream at the wrong moment, on purpose.","tag":"song","k":"night","id":"n51","d":39,"s":2,"sd":9,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Frosthold and Veldrock","h":["h12"],"x":"Juni takes the path a twisted signpost points to on the road to Veldrock, and meets a shepherd who has news.","k":"road","id":"r118","d":39,"s":2,"sd":9,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Last Dry Sock","at":"the road between Cragtooth Warren and Ironhaven","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Allie passes the Last Dry Sock, where a row of muddy adventurers' boots stand to dry and Sergeant Ivo Ottoway counts them by the door.","k":"road","id":"r119","d":39,"s":2,"sd":9,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Chess: Andrew v Joshua","at":"camp in The Sunken Vault","h":["h2","h11"],"x":"The Driftwood Chess comes out, and the evening turns thoughtful all at once. Being a queen down by move 28 is enough for Andrew, who tips the king to Joshua. Andrew slams the clock, which isn't…","tag":"chess","k":"night","id":"n49","d":38,"s":2,"sd":8,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"The Royal Shadows vs 2 Sirens and 2 Drowned","r":"won","at":"The Sunken Vault","h":["h9","h13","h11","h2"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f100","d":38,"s":2,"sd":8,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"With Cade hitting hardest, the Royal Shadows beat 2 Sirens and 2 Drowned in the exchange floor on the first floor of the Sunken Vault. Cade waited for the gap and put Headshot through it. The fight…"},{"t":"The Black Pack vs 2 Risen Dead, a Skeleton Archer and a Skeleton","r":"won","at":"The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h14","h3","h10"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f98","d":38,"s":2,"sd":8,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"Two Risen Dead, a Skeleton Archer and a Skeleton fall to the Black Pack in the ossuary on the second floor of the Ashveil Crypts. The skeleton took Ryan's Headshot full on and was never the same…"},{"t":"Morgan vs a Bone Construct","r":"won","at":"The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h18"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f99","d":38,"s":2,"sd":8,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"Nothing about it is easy, but Morgan barely beats a Bone Construct in the articulator's hall on the second floor of the Ashveil Crypts. Morgan's Lord of Beasts brought help, and the help earned its…"},{"t":"Kobold Peppercorn Stew","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Katie serves some Kobold Peppercorn Stew in Cragtooth Warren and waits, spoon raised, for the verdict. It has one firepepper in it, which is one too many.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m68","d":38,"s":2,"sd":8,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Blind Cavefish, 18 cm","at":"the flooded gallery of the Collapsed Mine","h":["h7","h17","h8","h5"],"x":"The rod bends, the line sings, and Corrine hauls out a blind cavefish of a full 18 cm at the flooded gallery of the Collapsed Mine. That is a personal best.","k":"catch","id":"c27","d":38,"s":2,"sd":8,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Honey-Glazed Golden Carp","at":"the Collapsed Mine","h":["h7","h17","h8","h5"],"x":"Nobody argues about who cooks in the Collapsed Mine: Corrine does, and tonight that means a Honey-Glazed Golden Carp. It is sticky in the best way. It was made with Troy's 39 cm golden carp.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m67","d":38,"s":2,"sd":8,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Hedge Greens and Eggs","at":"by the road to Ironhaven","h":["h1"],"x":"Nobody to impress by the road to Ironhaven, so Harry makes Hedge Greens and Eggs exactly the way Harry likes them. They are better than the hedge they came out of.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m69","d":38,"s":2,"sd":8,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Skillet Berry Cobbler","at":"by the road to Veldrock","h":["h12"],"x":"Supper for one by the road to Veldrock: Juni makes some Skillet Berry Cobbler and eats it straight from the pan. It stains every spoon at the fire.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m70","d":38,"s":2,"sd":8,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"\"Hollow Walks Behind Me\" by the fire","at":"camp in The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h3","h10","h14"],"x":"Ryan sings a song of their own slow and cold, and Olivia and Mark sing the last line in a whisper. Clementine closes its eyes, slowly, which from a cat is applause.","tag":"song","k":"night","id":"n48","d":38,"s":2,"sd":8,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Garrow's Span","at":"the road between Frosthold and Veldrock","h":["h12"],"x":"A laden wagon sticks halfway over Garrow's Span, and Juni and half the traffic heave until it pops free and the grateful driver pays Juni 3 silver.","k":"road","id":"r116","d":38,"s":2,"sd":8,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Frozen Ladle","at":"the road between Frosthold and Ironhaven","h":["h1"],"x":"Harry declares the secret of the Frozen Ladle stew to be turnip. It was, but the real secret is the other turnip.","k":"road","id":"r117","d":38,"s":2,"sd":8,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"The Royal Shadows vs 3 Cliff Crabs and a Sea Serpent","r":"won","at":"The Sunken Vault","h":["h9","h13","h11","h2"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f94","d":37,"s":2,"sd":7,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"Three Cliff Crabs and a Sea Serpent met the Royal Shadows in the sunken kitchens on the first floor of the Sunken Vault, and lost. Joshua's Arc Lightning ended it with a crackle while Keenan stayed…"},{"t":"Met Doctor Fabian Loom","at":"the road between Frosthold and Ironhaven","h":["h1"],"x":"Doctor Fabian Loom sets Harry's sprain with a real splint and a real sermon. It is the first sound medicine he has practised in years.","k":"road","id":"r113","d":37,"s":2,"sd":7,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"The Royal Shadows vs 3 Drowned and a Cliff Crab","r":"won","at":"The Sunken Vault","h":["h9","h13","h11","h2"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f95","d":37,"s":2,"sd":7,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"Three Drowned and a Cliff Crab fall to the Royal Shadows in the gatehouse guardroom on the first floor of the Sunken Vault. Keenan's Flame Jet set the Drowned alight. Cade found one thing that…"},{"t":"Met the Wet Boots Angling Club","at":"the road between Frosthold and Veldrock","h":["h12"],"x":"Old Eustace Tench of the Wet Boots Angling Club puts a finger to her lips as Juni comes up the bank for the first time. There is, they whisper, a fish under that stone.","k":"road","id":"r114","d":37,"s":2,"sd":7,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Morgan vs a Skeleton","r":"won","at":"The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h18"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f96","d":37,"s":2,"sd":7,"imp":1,"score":10,"x":"Morgan runs into a Skeleton in the skeletons' quiet corner on the second floor of the Ashveil Crypts and comes out on top. Last blow: Morgan, with Sic 'Em. Loot: 4 bones."},{"t":"The Pack of Carrbridge vs 3 Kobold Slingers","r":"won","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h4","h16"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f97","d":37,"s":2,"sd":7,"imp":1,"score":10,"x":"The Pack of Carrbridge meets 3 Kobold Slingers in the slingers' gallery on the first floor of Cragtooth Warren and makes short work of them. The last kobold slinger looks at the odds and leaves. The…"},{"t":"Ration-Bag Hash","at":"the Ashveil Crypts","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia feeds the crew in the Ashveil Crypts: some Ration-Bag Hash, and plenty of it. It holds together out of sheer spite.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m66","d":37,"s":2,"sd":7,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"\"Watchman's Lullaby\" by the fire","at":"camp in Cragtooth Warren","h":["h4"],"x":"Allie sings \"Watchman's Lullaby\" for whoever at the fire is missing someone, which turns out to be everyone. Pepper leans against the singer's leg for the whole song.","tag":"song","k":"night","id":"n46","d":37,"s":2,"sd":7,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"\"Brother Bellringer\" by the fire","at":"camp in The Collapsed Mine","h":["h7","h8","h5","h17"],"x":"Corrine leads \"Brother Bellringer\", forgets the second verse, makes one up, and Troy, Griffin and Amanda sing the made-up one louder. Maple tilts its head at the wrong notes, every one.","tag":"song","k":"night","id":"n47","d":37,"s":2,"sd":7,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Garrow's Span","at":"the road between Frosthold and Veldrock","h":["h12"],"x":"Juni pays Old Garrow 3 copper at Garrow's Span, and Old Garrow chalks a mark on the rail for every foot that crosses.","k":"road","id":"r115","d":37,"s":2,"sd":7,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Knucklebones: lost 4 silver","at":"Frosthold","h":["h1"],"tag":"table","k":"table","id":"g14","d":37,"s":2,"sd":7,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Matt vs a Frost Wolf","r":"won","at":"Frostspire","h":["h15"],"tag":"camp","k":"fight","id":"f93","d":36,"s":2,"sd":6,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"A Frost Wolf walks into Matt's camp on the first floor of Frostspire in the middle of the night, and Matt sees it off. Hit of the day: Matt's Hammer Down on the frost wolf. Loot: 2 pelts, 2 fangs &…"},{"t":"Tidal Riders vs 2 Kobolds and a Giant Rat","r":"won","at":"The Collapsed Mine","h":["h17","h8","h5","h7"],"tag":"camp","k":"fight","id":"f91","d":36,"s":2,"sd":6,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"Two Kobolds and a Giant Rat come at Tidal Riders' camp on the first floor of the Collapsed Mine in the middle of the night, and Tidal Riders beat them. The fight ended in a flash of Troy's Puppet…"},{"t":"Matt vs a Frost Wolf","r":"won","at":"Frostspire","h":["h15"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f92","d":36,"s":2,"sd":6,"imp":1,"score":10,"x":"Matt defeats a Frost Wolf in the wolf run on the first floor of Frostspire. Matt's Hammer Down took most of the fight out of the frost wolf in one go. Loot: 4 pelts."},{"t":"Toasted Cheese Trenchers","at":"the Ashveil Crypts","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia cooks Toasted Cheese Trenchers in the Ashveil Crypts. They are gone before anyone thinks of sharing.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m64","d":36,"s":2,"sd":6,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Brown Trout in Brown Butter","at":"the Sunken Vault","h":["h11","h9","h13","h2"],"x":"Nobody argues about who cooks in the Sunken Vault: Joshua does, and tonight that means a Brown Trout in Brown Butter. It has skin that crackles under the fork. Fresh fish tonight: Keenan's 21 cm…","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m65","d":36,"s":2,"sd":6,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"\"The Lizard Who Didn't Move\" by the fire","at":"camp in Cragtooth Warren","h":["h4","h16"],"x":"Allie laughs through the punchline of \"The Lizard Who Didn't Move\" before reaching it, which somehow makes it funnier.","tag":"song","k":"night","id":"n44","d":36,"s":2,"sd":6,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Checkers: Corrine v Griffin","at":"camp in The Collapsed Mine","h":["h7","h5"],"x":"Checkers on the log tonight, and Griffin insists the flat side of it is lucky. Griffin crowns the final piece with great care, and the camp applauds. A record begins this evening between Griffin and…","tag":"checkers","k":"night","id":"n45","d":36,"s":2,"sd":6,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Garrow's Span","at":"the road between Frosthold and Veldrock","h":["h1"],"x":"Harry pays 3 copper at Garrow's Span, and the chalk mark on the rail is added to a long, wobbly row.","k":"road","id":"r109","d":36,"s":2,"sd":6,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Frosthold and Veldrock","h":["h12"],"x":"Juni takes a pilgrim's heavy bundle on the road to Frosthold and finds it full of stones. The pilgrim says it is the whole point.","k":"road","id":"r110","d":36,"s":2,"sd":6,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Tolliver's causeway","at":"the road between The Salt Cliffs and The Sunken Vault","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"Keenan pays Tolliver Spratt the 3 copper at Tolliver's causeway without a word, and gets a salt biscuit for the road.","k":"road","id":"r111","d":36,"s":2,"sd":6,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the wreckers' false light","at":"the road between The Salt Cliffs and The Sunken Vault","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"A cache behind the wreckers' false light's loose stone gives Andrew 3 silver in old coin that the wreckers left for the sea.","k":"road","id":"r112","d":36,"s":2,"sd":6,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Knucklebones: lost 4 silver","at":"Frosthold","h":["h1"],"tag":"table","k":"table","id":"g13","d":36,"s":2,"sd":6,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between The Salt Cliffs and Saltmarrow","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"A royal courier thunders down the road to the Salt Cliffs at a flat gallop, and Cade is the only one to jump clear. The courier tosses back 7 silver for the trouble.","k":"road","id":"r107","d":35,"s":2,"sd":5,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Tidal Riders vs 3 Bounty Hunters and the Bounty Hunters' Captain","r":"won","at":"The Collapsed Mine","h":["h17","h8","h5","h7"],"tag":"bounty","k":"fight","id":"f86","d":35,"s":2,"sd":5,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"Three Bounty Hunters and the Bounty Hunters' Captain, sent for the price on Amanda's head, catch up with Tidal Riders in the Collapsed Mine and regret it. Three of them went down together, and they…"},{"t":"Tidal Riders vs 3 Giant Rats and a Kobold","r":"won","at":"The Collapsed Mine","h":["h17","h8","h5","h7"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f87","d":35,"s":2,"sd":5,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"Tidal Riders run into 3 Giant Rats and a Kobold in the ore bins on the first floor of the Collapsed Mine and come out on top. Troy spoke Smite once more, and the fight was over. Loot: 2 silver each,…"},{"t":"The Black Pack vs 3 Skeletons and 2 Risen Dead","r":"won","at":"The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h14","h3","h10"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f88","d":35,"s":2,"sd":5,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"The Black Pack cuts down 3 Skeletons and 2 Risen Dead in the coffin racks on the first floor of the Ashveil Crypts. Ryan hung Hunter's Mark on the risen dead, and the crew followed the mark. Mark…"},{"t":"Cards for Keenan, read by Auntie Gull","at":"the net lofts","h":["h9"],"x":"Keenan crosses Auntie Gull's palm with copper at the net lofts, and three cards come up: the Four of Wands, the Page of Cups and Strength. Auntie Gull nods slowly, pleased with all three.","k":"reading","id":"r106","d":35,"s":2,"sd":5,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"The Pack of Carrbridge vs 2 Goblin Archers and a Giant Bat","r":"won","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h4","h16"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f89","d":35,"s":2,"sd":5,"imp":1,"score":10,"x":"The Pack of Carrbridge wins out against 2 Goblin Archers and a Giant Bat in the new dig on the first floor of Cragtooth Warren, again. One Endless Winter from Allie and three of them were on the…"},{"t":"Morgan vs a Skeleton Archer","r":"won","at":"The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h18"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f90","d":35,"s":2,"sd":5,"imp":1,"score":10,"x":"It's a Skeleton Archer against Morgan in the choir loft on the second floor of the Ashveil Crypts, and it isn't close. Morgan closed it out with Pounce on the skeleton archer. Loot: 4 bones."},{"t":"Frost-Elk Stew","h":["h13"],"x":"Cade finds the Frosthold cart at the Saltmarrow market and tries some Frost-Elk Stew, a long way from home. It warms the hands before it gets anywhere near the stomach. (1 silver 8 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m61","d":35,"s":2,"sd":5,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Mushroom Pasty","h":["h11"],"x":"The market in Saltmarrow has a cook up from Hollowood today. Joshua queues for a Mushroom Pasty on the strength of the smell alone. It has seven kinds of mushroom and no regrets. (9 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m62","d":35,"s":2,"sd":5,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Fish on Sticks","at":"the Ashveil Crypts","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Supper in the Ashveil Crypts is Fish on Sticks, by Olivia. They stood round the fire like guests.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m63","d":35,"s":2,"sd":5,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Checkers: Andrew v Joshua","at":"camp in The Salt Cliffs","h":["h2","h11"],"x":"The Slate and Chalk Checkers is laid out, and the only sound is a piece being tapped on the board. Andrew walked into a double jump and now stares at the board in dignified grief. That was the first…","tag":"checkers","k":"night","id":"n42","d":35,"s":2,"sd":5,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"\"Old Barley\" by the fire","at":"camp in Cragtooth Warren","h":["h4"],"x":"Allie sings \"Old Barley\" by the fire, and the crew drift off to it, one by one. Rufus lies down with its chin on its paws and doesn't move till the last note.","tag":"song","k":"night","id":"n43","d":35,"s":2,"sd":5,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Ironhaven and Veldrock","h":["h12"],"x":"Juni walks through the echo valley in silence, letting the hills keep their voices to themselves. It is a great and strange quiet.","k":"road","id":"r105","d":35,"s":2,"sd":5,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Gannet ferry","at":"the road between The Salt Cliffs and Saltmarrow","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"Andrew pays Edda Dunmore 2 copper at the Gannet ferry for the pull across the creek, with the tide running out beneath.","k":"road","id":"r108","d":35,"s":2,"sd":5,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Met Captain Dorrit Salt","at":"the road between Ironhaven and Veldrock","h":["h12"],"x":"The Captain asks Juni to take the wheel of her cart for a spell. Juni steers it into a hedge, and is told that is the best landing she has seen.","k":"road","id":"r101","d":34,"s":2,"sd":4,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Tidal Riders vs 2 Kobold Slingers, 2 Giant Rats and a Kobold","r":"won","at":"The Collapsed Mine","h":["h17","h8","h5","h7"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f85","d":34,"s":2,"sd":4,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"Two Kobold Slingers, 2 Giant Rats and a Kobold fall to Tidal Riders in the main drift on the first floor of the Collapsed Mine. Corrine's Volley caught four of them at once. Without much fuss,…"},{"t":"Met Tansy Fell","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Saltmarrow","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"Cade finds Tansy Fell for the first time counting something under her breath, with Ledger beside her looking over the numbers.","k":"road","id":"r104","d":34,"s":2,"sd":4,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"The Pack of Carrbridge vs 2 Kobolds","r":"won","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h4","h16"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f84","d":34,"s":2,"sd":4,"imp":1,"score":10,"x":"With Allie hitting hardest, the Pack of Carrbridge puts down 2 Kobolds in the sentry hole on the first floor of Cragtooth Warren. Endless Winter caught two kobolds in one go. That was Allie. Loot: 7…"},{"t":"Miner's Pasty","h":["h1"],"x":"The dish of the week at The Pickaxe & Pint is Miner's Pasty. Harry takes the hint. It comes with a crust edge for the knockers. (9 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m57","d":34,"s":2,"sd":4,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Grey Bread with Dripping","h":["h1"],"x":"Harry queues for some Grey Bread with Dripping in Veldrock behind half the town. Worth it: it is grey, heavy and exactly right. (4 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m58","d":34,"s":2,"sd":4,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Twist-Bread on a Stick","at":"the Ashveil Crypts","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia makes some Twist-Bread on a Stick in the Ashveil Crypts and nobody talks while it's eaten. It has a scorch mark exactly where the cook looked away.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m59","d":34,"s":2,"sd":4,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Ration-Bag Hash","at":"the Collapsed Mine","h":["h7","h17","h8","h5"],"x":"Corrine makes some Ration-Bag Hash in the Collapsed Mine. It's Troy's favourite kind of thing, and Troy says so with his mouth full.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m60","d":34,"s":2,"sd":4,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Chess: Allie v Katie","at":"camp in Cragtooth Warren","h":["h4","h16"],"x":"Katie lets the queen go on move 30. Allie picks it up very gently, as if it might be a trick. It isn't. A queen on e7 ends it: Allie mates Katie on move 32. The loser Katie sits up first watch, and…","tag":"chess","k":"night","id":"n41","d":34,"s":2,"sd":4,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Gant's toll bridge","at":"the road between Ironhaven and Veldrock","h":["h12"],"x":"Juni fords the river below Gant's bridge rather than pay, and walks the next five miles in wet boots.","k":"road","id":"r102","d":34,"s":2,"sd":4,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Ashfen and The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Ryan looks at the strongbox for a long time and decides that the marsh may keep it. There is wisdom in knowing a bog's price.","k":"road","id":"r103","d":34,"s":2,"sd":4,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Blind Cavefish, 17 cm","at":"the flooded gallery of the Collapsed Mine","h":["h7","h17","h8","h5"],"x":"Nobody in the league has landed a blind cavefish before, and now Corrine has, at the flooded gallery of the Collapsed Mine. A first.","k":"catch","id":"c25","d":33,"s":2,"sd":3,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Met the Wet Boots Angling Club","at":"the road between Frostspire and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt stands by the Angling Club at dawn and is told, in a whisper, that the first rule of fishing is to say nothing. Matt has a lovely, silent morning.","k":"road","id":"r94","d":33,"s":2,"sd":3,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Walking-Cap Ragout","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Katie has the fire going early in Cragtooth Warren, and by dark the crew is eating some Walking-Cap Ragout. It has one mushroom in it that is still trying to leave.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m56","d":33,"s":2,"sd":3,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Brown Trout, 21 cm","at":"by a stream on the road to Saltmarrow","h":["h9","h13","h11","h2"],"x":"Watched closely by Cade, Keenan unhooks a brown trout by a stream on the road to Saltmarrow with the calm of a long career.","k":"catch","id":"c24","d":33,"s":2,"sd":3,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Nothing bit","at":"by a stream outside Frostspire","h":["h15"],"x":"Something moves in the dark by a stream outside Frostspire, but it is not on the hook. Matt decides that is fine.","k":"catch","id":"c26","d":33,"s":2,"sd":3,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"The Pack of Carrbridge vs 2 Kobolds and a Giant Bat","r":"won","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h4","h16"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f83","d":33,"s":2,"sd":3,"imp":1,"score":10,"x":"In the humming roost on the first floor of Cragtooth Warren, 2 Kobolds and a Giant Bat get in the Pack of Carrbridge's way, briefly. It swung on Allie's Endless Winter, and stayed swung. Allie's Ice…"},{"t":"Fen-Mist Chowder","h":["h3"],"x":"The dish of the week at The Damp Lantern is Fen-Mist Chowder. Ryan takes the hint. It is warmer than it looks. (1 silver)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m55","d":33,"s":2,"sd":3,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Leaning Mile","at":"the road between Ashfen and Carrbridge","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Mark stops to lean a shoulder on the Leaning Mile, and the old stone seems to settle another hair towards the ground.","k":"road","id":"r100","d":33,"s":2,"sd":3,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Snow Lamp","at":"the road between Frostspire and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt trims the Snow Lamp's wick with a borrowed knife and a steady hand and leaves 1 copper for the oil, as the tin asks.","k":"road","id":"r95","d":33,"s":2,"sd":3,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Shrine of Quiet Names","at":"the road between Ashfen and The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h18"],"x":"Morgan leaves a handful of marsh flowers at the Shrine of Quiet Names and pays 1 copper to the dish for the tending of them.","k":"road","id":"r96","d":33,"s":2,"sd":3,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Salt Carters' Hut","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Saltmarrow","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"The note on the Salt Carters' Hut door asks every guest to leave a stick of firewood. Cade leaves two.","k":"road","id":"r97","d":33,"s":2,"sd":3,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Ironhaven and Veldrock","h":["h1","h12"],"x":"Juni volunteers loudly to scout ahead on the road to Veldrock, but Harry goes instead. The road beyond is clear, a heron is rude, and Harry returns to a band that's glad of the report.","k":"road","id":"r98","d":33,"s":2,"sd":3,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Gant's toll bridge","at":"the road between Ironhaven and Veldrock","h":["h1","h12"],"x":"Juni pays 2 copper to cross, and Gant adds a coin to a jar already crowded with other people's bad luck.","k":"road","id":"r99","d":33,"s":2,"sd":3,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Crown and Anchor: won 2 silver","at":"Ironhaven","h":["h12"],"tag":"table","k":"table","id":"g12","d":33,"s":2,"sd":3,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Frosthold and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h15"],"x":"A shadow passes over the road to Whitepeak Pass, huge and quick. Everyone on the road lies flat. Matt is the first one up, and the first one to laugh.","k":"road","id":"r88","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Met Mags Halloran","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Saltmarrow","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"Over the fire Mags Halloran tells Cade where the money is this month: The Wolf Den, if he is brave.","k":"road","id":"r92","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Stolen from the bank","at":"the Ashfen dyke","h":["h18"],"x":"Scout steals a bog eel from the bucket at the Ashfen dyke, and Morgan cannot stay angry at that tail.","k":"catch","id":"c22","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Stolen from the bank","at":"the runoff pool at the mouth of the Collapsed Mine","h":["h7","h17","h8","h5"],"x":"Corrine lands a blind cavefish in the runoff pool at the mouth of the Collapsed Mine and Bear lands on it. It is not clear who won.","k":"catch","id":"c23","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Rampart Hotpot","h":["h1"],"x":"The market in Carrbridge has a cook up from Thornwall today. Harry queues for some Rampart Hotpot on the strength of the smell alone. It fights back a little at the edges, where the crust went to…","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m47","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Varro Brothers' Spiced Bun","h":["h1"],"x":"Varro Brothers' Spiced Bun, eaten on an Ironhaven doorstep by Harry, who refuses to share. It leaves sugar on everything for the rest of the day. (6 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m48","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Forge-Bellows Pepper Pot","h":["h1"],"x":"Harry has a Forge-Bellows Pepper Pot at The Gilded Flagon and asks Madame Ostrava for the recipe. His favourite kind of thing. (2 silver 2 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m49","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Salamander Skewers","h":["h13"],"x":"A cart from Veldrock has come for market day in Carrbridge, selling Salamander Skewers. Cade buys one to see what the fuss is. They are still warm in the pack the next morning. (3 silver 9 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m50","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Grey Bread with Dripping","h":["h11"],"x":"A cart from Veldrock has come for market day in Carrbridge, selling some Grey Bread with Dripping. Joshua buys one to see what the fuss is. It drips in the right places. (4 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m51","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Skillet Berry Cobbler","at":"by the road to Ashfen","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Skillet Berry Cobbler by the road to Ashfen: Olivia is sure it's meant to smell like that. It isn't. Nobody sleeps well.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m52","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Skillet Berry Cobbler","at":"by the road to Saltmarrow","h":["h11","h9","h13","h2"],"x":"Joshua serves some Skillet Berry Cobbler by the road to Saltmarrow, and Keenan closes his eyes on the first mouthful. A favourite. It stains every spoon at the fire.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m53","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Ration-Bag Hash","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Allie smells some Ration-Bag Hash from the far side of the camp in Cragtooth Warren and comes at a run. Katie made it. It turns out better than the ration bag had any right to.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m54","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Pickaxe Rest","at":"the road between The Collapsed Mine and Veldrock","h":["h17","h5","h7","h8"],"x":"Troy buys a miners' breakfast at the Pickaxe Rest for 1 silver: a Smoked Sausage Coil, black bread and a mug of tea strong enough to float a nail.","k":"road","id":"r87","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Last Stove","at":"the road between Frosthold and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt warms both hands at the Last Stove while Hild Aaskov counts how many coats are drying on the line this time.","k":"road","id":"r89","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Scratched Stone","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Ironhaven","h":["h1","h12"],"x":"Jeff carves their name into the Scratched Stone, small, between a farmer and a dead king.","k":"road","id":"r90","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Leaning Mile","at":"the road between Ashfen and Carrbridge","h":["h18"],"x":"The Leaning Mile says it is one mile to Carrbridge and a dozen to Ashfen, though anyone can see the dyke from where Morgan stands.","k":"road","id":"r91","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Ashfen and Carrbridge","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia buys a hot bowl from a roadside stall on the road to Ashfen for a hungry beggar, paying 2 copper. The beggar says a long blessing over it.","k":"road","id":"r93","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Crown and Anchor: lost 4 silver","at":"Ironhaven","h":["h12"],"tag":"table","k":"table","id":"g10","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Crown and Anchor: lost 4 silver","at":"Ironhaven","h":["h1"],"tag":"table","k":"table","id":"g11","d":32,"s":2,"sd":2,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Met the Muddy Boot Pack","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Ironhaven","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"Snaggle blocks Joshua's way with a rope and a wooden sign that reads TOL. Joshua pays one copper and is given a receipt made of bark.","k":"road","id":"r82","d":31,"s":2,"sd":1,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Met Old Maudie","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Ironhaven","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Prudence and Clementine are right here, Old Maudie says to Ryan, but Tuesday has taken the chance to wander. A search begins.","k":"road","id":"r84","d":31,"s":2,"sd":1,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Fishing","at":"by a stream on the road to Ashfen","h":["h18"],"x":"The line catches the neck of a bottle by a stream on the road to Ashfen. Morgan unrolls a letter signed by Troy and reads it twice.","k":"catch","id":"c21","d":31,"s":2,"sd":1,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Nobody sleeps until Allie has read for The Pack of Carrbridge. The night…","h":["h4","h16"],"k":"reading","id":"r86","d":31,"s":2,"sd":1,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"Nobody sleeps until Allie has read for The Pack of Carrbridge. The night before Cragtooth Warren, three cards: the Seven of Cups, the Two of Wands and the Knight of Cups. Some good, some not."},{"t":"Fried River Fish in a Paper Cone","h":["h1"],"x":"Harry buys some Fried River Fish in a Paper Cone in Carrbridge and eats it standing up. It comes wrapped in last week's tariff notices. (8 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m44","d":31,"s":2,"sd":1,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Walking-Cap Ragout","h":["h11"],"x":"Jolly Mott talks Joshua into some Walking-Cap Ragout at The Honest Toll. Good advice: it is rich, dark and only slightly mobile. (2 silver 1 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m45","d":31,"s":2,"sd":1,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Merchant's Honest Honey Cake","h":["h2"],"x":"Jolly Mott has written Merchant's Honest Honey Cake on the board at The Honest Toll in letters a foot high: dish of the week. Andrew orders it before sitting down. It is sticky in a way that follows…","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m46","d":31,"s":2,"sd":1,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Ashfen ferry","at":"the road between Ashfen and Carrbridge","h":["h18"],"x":"Morgan sees an eye the size of a plate in the water beside the Ashfen ferry. Corve poles a little faster.","k":"road","id":"r77","d":31,"s":2,"sd":1,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Ashfen and Carrbridge","h":["h18"],"x":"Morgan claims a stick-sword from two squabbling children on the road to Ashfen for the good of the peace. The peace is a long way from restored.","k":"road","id":"r78","d":31,"s":2,"sd":1,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Last Stove","at":"the road between Frosthold and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt reads the rumour board at the Last Stove, a hundred scraps pinned over each other, and picks out one that smells of truth: The Sunken Vault.","k":"road","id":"r79","d":31,"s":2,"sd":1,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Whitepeak Cairn","at":"the road between Frosthold and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt stops at the Whitepeak Cairn, where a pair of walkers are stacking their stones in silence.","k":"road","id":"r80","d":31,"s":2,"sd":1,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Last Dry Sock","at":"the road between Cragtooth Warren and Ironhaven","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Katie stops at the Last Dry Sock as Sergeant Ivo Ottoway hangs a fresh pair of socks on the pole with great ceremony.","k":"road","id":"r81","d":31,"s":2,"sd":1,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Four Stones","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Ironhaven","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"At the Four Stones Andrew finds a flat stone, wipes it clean and sets it on the nearest heap with the rest.","k":"road","id":"r83","d":31,"s":2,"sd":1,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Four Stones","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Ironhaven","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Mark follows the well-worn road from the Four Stones, which is well worn for a reason. It is smooth and kind.","k":"road","id":"r85","d":31,"s":2,"sd":1,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"The Royal Shadows vs 2 Drakes and the Mimic King","r":"won","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h9","h13","h11","h2"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f82","d":30,"s":1,"sd":30,"imp":5,"score":65,"x":"At the bottom of Cragtooth Warren, The Royal Shadows put an end to 2 Drakes and the Mimic King. Cade's Aimed Shot saw to the Mimic King, Andrew's Sunder and Can't Stop Now did the rest, and Joshua…"},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between The King's Road and Thornwall","h":["h17","h5","h7","h8"],"x":"A torn treasure map blows across the King's Road and wraps around Amanda's ankle. It is faded, but the Collapsed Mine is clearly marked.","k":"road","id":"r71","d":30,"s":1,"sd":30,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Tench, 22 cm","at":"Wetfoot Ford","h":["h18"],"x":"The books show no Tench until today, when Morgan lands one at Wetfoot Ford.","k":"catch","id":"c18","d":30,"s":1,"sd":30,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Arctic Char, 21 cm","at":"the tarn on Whitepeak Pass","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt adds a new name to the league's catch book at the tarn on Whitepeak Pass: Arctic Char, 21 cm, never taken before.","k":"catch","id":"c20","d":30,"s":1,"sd":30,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Wraith-Chill Sorbet","at":"the Frosthold feast-day tables","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt is first in line for the Frosthold feast-day Wraith-Chill Sorbet, cooked from parts adventurers sold in town. It is cold enough to whisper. (8 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m42","d":30,"s":1,"sd":30,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"the Last Stove","at":"the road between Frosthold and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt tells the Last Stove its own best story of the road, and the room cheers and the stove, somehow, glows brighter.","k":"road","id":"r73","d":30,"s":1,"sd":30,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Brown Trout, 27 cm","at":"the King's Road ford","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia and Mark share a flask at the King's Road ford, a quiet hour, and a brown trout that nobody will admit was luck.","k":"catch","id":"c19","d":30,"s":1,"sd":30,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Ration-Bag Hash","at":"on the King's Road","h":["h7","h17","h8","h5"],"x":"Ration-Bag Hash on the King's Road: Troy says it's the best thing Corrine has ever made, and says so again in the morning. It turns out better than the ration bag had any right to.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m43","d":30,"s":1,"sd":30,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Hunting in The King's Road","at":"The King's Road","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia crawls half a mile on hands and knees behind the marks and comes out where she started. The marks were a fallen log's.","tag":"hunt","k":"road","id":"r68","d":30,"s":1,"sd":30,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Hunting in The King's Road","at":"The King's Road","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"The patient hunter eats well. Mark lets the rabbit hop into the open and takes it there. A ration.","tag":"hunt","k":"road","id":"r69","d":30,"s":1,"sd":30,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Hunting in The King's Road","at":"The King's Road","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Ryan looks at the family at the edge of the firelight and at the size of the supper, and says nothing. They move on without being asked. The meal tastes a little less of anything.","tag":"hunt","k":"road","id":"r70","d":30,"s":1,"sd":30,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Lakeside Lamprey","at":"the road between The King's Road and Thornwall","h":["h17","h5","h7","h8"],"x":"Griffin fishes the Lakeside Lamprey's pond without a bet or a boast, and the water gives back a quiet hour and a few good fish.","k":"road","id":"r72","d":30,"s":1,"sd":30,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Whitepeak Cairn","at":"the road between Frosthold and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt adds a stone to the Whitepeak Cairn, as every traveller to the pass does, and feels the weight of the ones beneath it.","k":"road","id":"r74","d":30,"s":1,"sd":30,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Wetfoot Ford","at":"the road between Bleakmarsh and Thornmere Ruins","h":["h18"],"x":"At Wetfoot Ford the fish are slow and the water is clear, and Morgan comes up with a catch and a very wet sleeve.","k":"road","id":"r75","d":30,"s":1,"sd":30,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Met the Off-Key Collective","at":"the road between Carrbridge and The King's Road","h":["h1","h12"],"x":"The Collective write a song about Jeff. It has seven verses, two choruses and five different endings, one for each of them.","k":"road","id":"r76","d":30,"s":1,"sd":30,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Met Tansy Fell","at":"the road between The King's Road and Thornwall","h":["h17","h5","h7","h8"],"x":"Troy helps Tansy Fell clear a barn. The ferrets do the work. Troy holds the sack and the lamp, and is thanked like a partner.","k":"road","id":"r66","d":29,"s":1,"sd":29,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Move for move, it's the Sire's Trap, as the Sire of a Saltmarrow café laid it,…","h":["h4","h16"],"k":"night","id":"n37","d":29,"s":1,"sd":29,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"Move for move, it's the Sire's Trap, as the Sire of a Saltmarrow café laid it, giving up his queen for a mate by three small pieces, and someone at the fire says so. 7 moves. Allie mates Katie with…"},{"t":"Cards for Morgan, read by Old Marrow","at":"a lean-to behind the undertaker's","h":["h18"],"x":"Morgan sits down across from Old Marrow at a lean-to behind the undertaker's. Three cards: the Ace of Wands, the Star and the King of Swords. A spread to sleep well on.","k":"reading","id":"r64","d":29,"s":1,"sd":29,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Silver Roach, 22 cm","at":"the King's Road ford","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia reels in a silver roach at the King's Road ford, 22 cm of cheerful wriggling.","k":"catch","id":"c16","d":29,"s":1,"sd":29,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Golden Carp, 39 cm","at":"the Thornwall millpond","h":["h8"],"x":"Troy unhooks a Golden Carp at the Thornwall millpond very slowly, in case it is a dream and the sudden movement ends it.","k":"catch","id":"c17","d":29,"s":1,"sd":29,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Yeti-Bun","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt waits out the market-day crush in Frosthold for a Yeti-Bun, trading gossip with the queue. It is so soft it sighs when you bite it. (6 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m40","d":29,"s":1,"sd":29,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Bramble-and-Barb Tart","h":["h5"],"x":"The dish of the week at The Sagging Beam is Bramble-and-Barb Tart. Griffin takes the hint. It leaves a purple mark on the lip that lasts till supper. (1 silver 4 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m41","d":29,"s":1,"sd":29,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Ashfen and Bleakmarsh","h":["h18"],"x":"Morgan finds leeches on both ankles and treats each with a spark. It is quick and nasty, and Morgan grins through it.","k":"road","id":"r65","d":29,"s":1,"sd":29,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Lakeside Lamprey","at":"the road between The King's Road and Thornwall","h":["h17","h5","h7","h8"],"x":"The Lakeside Lamprey's heron stalks along the porch rail as Griffin passes, studies his pack for fish, finds none, and bows anyway.","k":"road","id":"r67","d":29,"s":1,"sd":29,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Matt vs the Raiders' Captain, a Bandit Archer and a Bandit","r":"lost","at":"Frosthold","h":["h15"],"tag":"road","k":"fight","id":"f75","d":28,"s":1,"sd":28,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"On the walls of Frosthold, the Raiders' Captain, a Bandit Archer and a Bandit win the day, and Matt, overwhelmed, is left on the floor. Injured: Matt (bruised ribs)."},{"t":"Met Brother Aldo","at":"the road between Ashfen and The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h18"],"x":"Brother Aldo is too ill to walk, so Morgan shoulders the pack and most of the pilgrim as far as the next shelter.","k":"road","id":"r60","d":28,"s":1,"sd":28,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Golden Grayling, 33 cm","at":"the King's Road ford","h":["h12","h1"],"x":"A first for the whole league: Jeff pulls a Golden Grayling at the King's Road ford and holds it up as proof.","k":"catch","id":"c15","d":28,"s":1,"sd":28,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Hunting in The King's Road","at":"The King's Road","h":["h17","h5","h7","h8"],"x":"Another crew was on this buck first, and Troy says so. In return they hand over a share of the kill without being asked. A ration.","tag":"hunt","k":"road","id":"r63","d":28,"s":1,"sd":28,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Hedge Greens and Eggs","at":"on the King's Road","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia cooks Hedge Greens and Eggs on the King's Road while the rest pretend to keep watch. They have eggs in them nobody asked too closely about.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m38","d":28,"s":1,"sd":28,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Skillet Berry Cobbler","at":"on the King's Road","h":["h7","h17","h8","h5"],"x":"Amanda smells some Skillet Berry Cobbler from the far side of the camp on the King's Road and comes at a run. Corrine made it. It stains every spoon at the fire.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m39","d":28,"s":1,"sd":28,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Last Dry Sock","at":"the road between Cragtooth Warren and Ironhaven","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"Joshua reads the rumour wall of the Last Dry Sock while Sergeant Ivo Ottoway stamps a ticket for each reader. The freshest scrap speaks of Frostspire.","k":"road","id":"r57","d":28,"s":1,"sd":28,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Hunting in The King's Road","at":"The King's Road","h":["h1","h12"],"x":"An old hunter walks into the firelight, shares a pot of tea with Harry, and says the trail goes uphill from the stream. Then walks out again.","tag":"hunt","k":"road","id":"r58","d":28,"s":1,"sd":28,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Wheel and Whistle","at":"the road between Carrbridge and The King's Road","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Ryan spots Big Ancel Pennyfeather at the Wheel and Whistle chalking the day's departures on a board almost as wide as the wall.","k":"road","id":"r59","d":28,"s":1,"sd":28,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Shrine of Quiet Names","at":"the road between Ashfen and The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h18"],"x":"Morgan drops 1 copper in the dish at the Shrine of Quiet Names and lights a taper for the dead of Ashfen.","k":"road","id":"r61","d":28,"s":1,"sd":28,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Hunting in The King's Road","at":"The King's Road","h":["h17","h5","h7","h8"],"x":"Troy takes the long safe trail along the valley floor. It is slow, and it is dry, and he reads every bend of it.","tag":"hunt","k":"road","id":"r62","d":28,"s":1,"sd":28,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Met the Fourth-Best Company","at":"the road between Ashfen and Carrbridge","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Mark hears Captain Mabb of the Fourth-Best Company claiming his last kill in a roadside inn. The story has more dragons in it.","k":"road","id":"r51","d":27,"s":1,"sd":27,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Cragtooth Warren and Ironhaven","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"A bridal party sweeps Keenan up on the road to Ironhaven and carries him for a mile of dancing. Keenan leaves at the next gate with a ribbon and a cake.","k":"road","id":"r56","d":27,"s":1,"sd":27,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Bog Eel, 73 cm","at":"the Ashfen ferry","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia catches a bog eel at the Ashfen ferry, the league's very first, and the bank applauds like it was planned.","k":"catch","id":"c12","d":27,"s":1,"sd":27,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Stolen-Sausage Hotpot","at":"on the King's Road","h":["h7","h17","h8","h5"],"x":"Corrine makes some Stolen-Sausage Hotpot on the King's Road, mostly for Griffin, who knows it and is very pleased. It is the bandits' own beans, which feels right.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m37","d":27,"s":1,"sd":27,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Cards for Ryan, read by Sabine Venn","at":"the toll-house parlour","h":["h3"],"x":"Sabine Venn lays three cards out for Ryan at the toll-house parlour: the Page of Wands, the King of Wands upside down and the Four of Wands. Sabine Venn hums over the cards and won't commit.","k":"reading","id":"r52","d":27,"s":1,"sd":27,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Cards for Matt, read by Grandmother Skaldi","at":"a hut on the edge of the snowfield","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt sits down across from Grandmother Skaldi at a hut on the edge of the snowfield. Three cards: the Hierophant upside down, the Sun and the King of Wands. The spread can't make up its mind, and…","k":"reading","id":"r53","d":27,"s":1,"sd":27,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Twist-Bread on a Stick","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Katie cooks some Twist-Bread on a Stick in Cragtooth Warren. It has a scorch mark exactly where the cook looked away.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m36","d":27,"s":1,"sd":27,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"First game of chess between Allie and Katie, at camp in Cragtooth Warren:…","h":["h4","h16"],"k":"night","id":"n31","d":27,"s":1,"sd":27,"imp":1,"score":10,"x":"First game of chess between Allie and Katie, at camp in Cragtooth Warren: Allie by a whisker, and both are already keeping score."},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Ashfen and Carrbridge","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Ryan takes a pilgrim's heavy bundle on the road to Carrbridge and finds it full of stones. The pilgrim says it is the whole point.","k":"road","id":"r50","d":27,"s":1,"sd":27,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Hunting in The King's Road","at":"The King's Road","h":["h1","h12"],"x":"Harry walks past the blaze without a glance and finds the day's first fresh sign by an hour of plain looking.","tag":"hunt","k":"road","id":"r54","d":27,"s":1,"sd":27,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Hunting in The King's Road","at":"The King's Road","h":["h1","h12"],"x":"A clutch of eggs lies in the grass, unwatched. Jeff takes only what a fox would, and puts the rest back under the leaves. A ration, wrapped in moss.","tag":"hunt","k":"road","id":"r55","d":27,"s":1,"sd":27,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"The hunters of Thulgarath vs Thulgarath the Polite Destroyer","r":"won","at":"Thornwall","h":["h7","h8","h5","h17"],"tag":"hyper","k":"fight","id":"f72","d":26,"s":1,"sd":26,"imp":5,"score":279,"x":"Thulgarath the Polite Destroyer is dead! It falls to Corrine, Troy, Griffin, Amanda in Thornwall, and Corrine carves the Gutter Spoon from what's left."},{"t":"Troll Haunch","at":"on the King's Road","h":["h1","h12"],"x":"Harry makes a Troll Haunch on the King's Road and nobody talks while it's eaten. It has to be carved faster than it heals.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m35","d":26,"s":1,"sd":26,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"It's official at camp in Cragtooth Warren: Andrew and Cade are checkers…","h":["h2","h13"],"k":"night","id":"n29","d":26,"s":1,"sd":26,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"It's official at camp in Cragtooth Warren: Andrew and Cade are checkers rivals. 1-2, and neither will let it rest."},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Cragtooth Warren and Ironhaven","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Allie beats out a stack fire beside the road to Cragtooth Warren with a wet coat and a lot of language. The farm is saved, and the farmer loads her down with bread.","k":"road","id":"r45","d":26,"s":1,"sd":26,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Ashfen and Carrbridge","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Mark waves everyone off the road to Carrbridge and clears a lane while the cart rolls on by. No one is hurt, and the barrels end up in a hedge, whole, to a round of applause.","k":"road","id":"r49","d":26,"s":1,"sd":26,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Fried River Fish in a Paper Cone","h":["h1"],"x":"Harry hands over 8 copper in Carrbridge and gets some Fried River Fish in a Paper Cone in return. A fair trade. It comes in a cone of somebody's unpaid toll notice.","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m32","d":26,"s":1,"sd":26,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Toasted Cheese Trenchers","at":"by the road to Carrbridge","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia lays out Toasted Cheese Trenchers by the road to Carrbridge on a flat stone, like a proper table. They drip cheese off the edge of the bread in the best way.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m33","d":26,"s":1,"sd":26,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Ration-Bag Hash","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Ration-Bag Hash in Cragtooth Warren, by Katie. Allie goes very quiet, which is how Allie says thank you for her favourite.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m34","d":26,"s":1,"sd":26,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Lakeside Lamprey","at":"the road between The King's Road and Thornwall","h":["h17","h5","h7","h8"],"x":"Peg Marlow calls out the day's fish from the Lakeside Lamprey's porch, and Corrine hears the list twice before reaching the door.","k":"road","id":"r46","d":26,"s":1,"sd":26,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Wheel and Whistle","at":"the road between Carrbridge and The King's Road","h":["h1","h12"],"x":"Jeff passes the Wheel and Whistle, where a stable lad whistles the horses to their stalls and one actually goes.","k":"road","id":"r47","d":26,"s":1,"sd":26,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Leaning Mile","at":"the road between Ashfen and Carrbridge","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Mark finds a clear patch on the back of the Leaning Mile and carves a name there, small and straight against the lean.","k":"road","id":"r48","d":26,"s":1,"sd":26,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Shrine of Quiet Names","at":"the road between Ashfen and The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia leaves 1 copper in the dish at the Shrine of Quiet Names and whispers the name of someone gone.","k":"road","id":"r52","d":26,"s":1,"sd":26,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Chess: Mark v Olivia","at":"The Damp Lantern","h":["h14","h10"],"x":"Olivia loses the queen on move 12 and stares at the empty square as if it might come back. Olivia looks at the board, counts a queen missing, and tips the king on move 14. A streak of five has made…","tag":"chess","k":"night","id":"n27","d":25,"s":1,"sd":25,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Met Doctor Fabian Loom","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Ironhaven","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Allie agrees to try the Doctor's famous tonic. It is mostly honey and fear, and does them no harm whatever.","k":"road","id":"r37","d":25,"s":1,"sd":25,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"The bandit drops into the road, points at Harry and says, you, Crooked Cards,…","h":["h12","h1"],"k":"night","id":"n26","d":25,"s":1,"sd":25,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"The bandit drops into the road, points at Harry and says, you, Crooked Cards, one round, loser pays. The bandit has lost, and the bandit knows it, and Bandit's Marked Card is held out with great…"},{"t":"Aunt Crumb reads for Amanda at the back of the pie shop, their first time…","h":["h17"],"k":"reading","id":"r43","d":25,"s":1,"sd":25,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"Aunt Crumb reads for Amanda at the back of the pie shop, their first time across a fortune-teller's table. Amanda keeps their hands in their lap and stares at the Wheel of Fortune."},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Ashfen and The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia rights a signpost on the road to Ashfen that points confidently at a ditch. A passing pedlar is glad of it.","k":"road","id":"r40","d":25,"s":1,"sd":25,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Toll-Bridge Fritters","h":["h1"],"x":"Harry stops for Toll-Bridge Fritters in Carrbridge. They are worth the toll on their own. (6 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m29","d":25,"s":1,"sd":25,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Ration-Bag Hash","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h11","h9","h13","h2"],"x":"Cade scrapes the pot clean of Joshua's Ration-Bag Hash in Cragtooth Warren and looks round for more. Cade's favourite kind of thing.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m30","d":25,"s":1,"sd":25,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Amanda beats Griffin at chess at The Sagging Beam, the first of what Griffin…","h":["h17","h5"],"k":"night","id":"n28","d":25,"s":1,"sd":25,"imp":1,"score":10,"x":"Amanda beats Griffin at chess at The Sagging Beam, the first of what Griffin promises will be many games, all of them won by Griffin."},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Ironhaven","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Allie buys a spoonful of honey from a beekeeper's stall for a copper, and then a second spoonful on credit.","k":"road","id":"r38","d":25,"s":1,"sd":25,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Four Stones","at":"the road between Carrbridge and Ironhaven","h":["h1","h12"],"x":"Harry adds a pebble at the Four Stones and watches the heap by the nearest pillar slide a little and settle.","k":"road","id":"r39","d":25,"s":1,"sd":25,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Met the Off-Key Collective","at":"the road between Hollowood and Thornwall","h":["h17","h5","h7","h8"],"x":"Corrine is made the judge of a contest between the Collective and a pair of drunken crows. The crows have the better voices.","k":"road","id":"r41","d":25,"s":1,"sd":25,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Shrine of the Footsore Saint","at":"the road between Hollowood and Thornwall","h":["h17","h5","h7","h8"],"x":"Troy pays 1 copper at the Shrine of the Footsore Saint and sits on the low stone, easing a boot off with a groan.","k":"road","id":"r42","d":25,"s":1,"sd":25,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Whitepeak Cairn","at":"the road between Frosthold and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h15"],"x":"Matt lifts a boulder for the Whitepeak Cairn and drops it on a foot, and the cairn is forgiven, but only just.","k":"road","id":"r44","d":25,"s":1,"sd":25,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Snow Lamp","at":"the road between Frostspire and Whitepeak Pass","h":["h15"],"x":"An old pilgrim at the Snow Lamp tells Matt that the flame was lit by the first traveller to cross this pass, and has never gone out since. Matt leaves 2 copper to keep it.","k":"road","id":"r31","d":24,"s":1,"sd":24,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between The Greenwood and Hollowood","h":["h7"],"x":"A raven beside the road to Hollowood tells Corrine something about Goblin Camp in a voice like an old man, and flies off before Corrine can ask a thing.","k":"road","id":"r32","d":24,"s":1,"sd":24,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Mere Carp, 77 cm","at":"the Wolfwater ferry","h":["h5","h17","h8"],"x":"Griffin lands a mere carp at the Wolfwater ferry, the first the league has ever seen. The anglers will want to hear about it.","k":"catch","id":"c11","d":24,"s":1,"sd":24,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"The bandit steps out on the road to Hollowood with a hopeful expression and a…","h":["h17","h8","h5"],"k":"night","id":"n23","d":24,"s":1,"sd":24,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"The bandit steps out on the road to Hollowood with a hopeful expression and a well-worn set of Crooked Cards, and nobody can quite bring themselves to draw a blade. The bandit reads the final board…"},{"t":"A rivalry is born at camp in the Ashveil Crypts: Mark beats Olivia at chess,…","h":["h14","h10"],"k":"night","id":"n24","d":24,"s":1,"sd":24,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"A rivalry is born at camp in the Ashveil Crypts: Mark beats Olivia at chess, and the record stands at 3-0."},{"t":"Rat-on-a-Stick","h":["h17"],"x":"Rat-on-a-Stick at The Watching Oak: Amanda cleans the plate. It is better than it has any right to be. (1 silver 5 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m25","d":24,"s":1,"sd":24,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Hammerhand Mixed Grill","h":["h1"],"x":"Harry has a Hammerhand Mixed Grill at The Gilded Flagon and sends compliments to Madame Ostrava. It comes on a shield with a dent in it that has a story. (3 silver 5 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m26","d":24,"s":1,"sd":24,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Rat-on-a-Stick","h":["h7","h8","h5"],"x":"Corrine, Troy and Griffin take the corner table at The Watching Oak and work through a Rat-on-a-Stick together. It is the kind of thing nobody admits to liking, then has two. (1 silver 5 copper each)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m27","d":24,"s":1,"sd":24,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Last Dry Sock","at":"the road between Cragtooth Warren and Ironhaven","h":["h12"],"x":"The thief outruns Jeff across a field, but drops one boot every ten paces. Jeff gathers them all, bitterly, on the way home.","k":"road","id":"r29","d":24,"s":1,"sd":24,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Last Dry Sock","at":"the road between Cragtooth Warren and Ironhaven","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"At dawn Sergeant Ivo Ottoway drags Joshua out to the Last Dry Sock's yard for a drill, and then, satisfied, gives out breakfast to all who survived it.","k":"road","id":"r30","d":24,"s":1,"sd":24,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Crooked Kettle","at":"the road between Hollowood and The Wolf Den","h":["h17","h5","h8"],"x":"Troy smells woodsmoke and bay leaf a long way before the Crooked Kettle comes into view among the trees.","k":"road","id":"r33","d":24,"s":1,"sd":24,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Wheel and Whistle","at":"the road between Carrbridge and The King's Road","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Big Ancel Pennyfeather sets a trencher in front of Allie for 1 silver. The gravy comes in a boat, and the boat in a second boat.","k":"road","id":"r34","d":24,"s":1,"sd":24,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Carrbridge and The King's Road","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"The elephant on the King's Road has a hat. Allie says nothing about it. The elephant's keeper, a small old woman, says nothing about Allie's hat either, and they part friends.","k":"road","id":"r35","d":24,"s":1,"sd":24,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Last Dry Sock","at":"the road between Cragtooth Warren and Ironhaven","h":["h1"],"x":"Harry spots the sock sign at the Last Dry Sock, damp at one end and flapping hopefully at the other.","k":"road","id":"r36","d":24,"s":1,"sd":24,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"The Ford Ghost got away","at":"the King's Road ford","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Katie held The Ford Ghost at the King's Road ford for twenty heartbeats. The line did not. The legend swims on.","k":"catch","id":"c8","d":23,"s":1,"sd":23,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Allie and Katie settle in over checkers at camp on the King's Road, and Allie…","h":["h4","h16"],"k":"night","id":"n21","d":23,"s":1,"sd":23,"imp":1,"score":10,"x":"Allie and Katie settle in over checkers at camp on the King's Road, and Allie takes the first one. Katie writes it down, which is a bad sign."},{"t":"Hunting in The Greenwood","at":"The Greenwood","h":["h7"],"x":"Corrine ties a strip of cloth to the nearest branch to mark the spot, reads which way the animal was heading, and goes round to meet it.","tag":"hunt","k":"road","id":"r26","d":23,"s":1,"sd":23,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Hunting in The Greenwood","at":"The Greenwood","h":["h7"],"x":"Corrine waits and the quarry does not come. After an hour, a gust of wind turns, and it knows. It is gone.","tag":"hunt","k":"road","id":"r27","d":23,"s":1,"sd":23,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Cragtooth Warren and Ironhaven","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"Andrew limps in new boots on the road to Ironhaven, and Joshua calls a halt to look at the blisters. The band rests on a bank while Andrew soaks in a stream, and the walk after is lighter.","k":"road","id":"r28","d":23,"s":1,"sd":23,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Silver Roach, 12 cm","at":"the King's Road ford","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"A first for the whole league: Katie pulls a silver roach at the King's Road ford and holds it up as proof.","k":"catch","id":"c5","d":22,"s":1,"sd":22,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Brown Trout, 22 cm","at":"the King's Road ford","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"The books show no Brown Trout until today, when Katie lands one at the King's Road ford.","k":"catch","id":"c7","d":22,"s":1,"sd":22,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Word spreads of a song by the fire: Harry led \"The Star-Counter's Tune\", and…","h":["h1","h12"],"k":"night","id":"n19","d":22,"s":1,"sd":22,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"Word spreads of a song by the fire: Harry led \"The Star-Counter's Tune\", and those who heard it are still talking about it."},{"t":"Hunting in The Greenwood","at":"The Greenwood","h":["h7"],"x":"Corrine has the doe in a clear line, sees the fawn behind it, and lowers the bow. A hunter's choice and nobody's rule. The two walk on, light on their feet.","tag":"hunt","k":"road","id":"r25","d":22,"s":1,"sd":22,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Hunting in The King's Road","at":"The King's Road","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Allie leaves the nest alone, steps wide around it and watches the hen circle back. The woods are a larder, but not that one.","tag":"hunt","k":"road","id":"r22","d":22,"s":1,"sd":22,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Hunting in The King's Road","at":"The King's Road","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"The push comes too soon. The quarry that was a hundred paces off is a thousand paces off by the time Allie has found her feet.","tag":"hunt","k":"road","id":"r23","d":22,"s":1,"sd":22,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Hunting in The Greenwood","at":"The Greenwood","h":["h7"],"x":"Corrine's arrow catches a hare and it gets away into the grass. Corrine waits an hour for it to lie down and stiffen, and follows the blood afterward. Slow work and the right kind. A ration.","tag":"hunt","k":"road","id":"r24","d":22,"s":1,"sd":22,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"The Royal Shadows vs 3 Kobolds and a Giant Bat","r":"won","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h9","h13","h11","h2"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f59","d":21,"s":1,"sd":21,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"Cade hits hardest as the Royal Shadows see off 3 Kobolds and a Giant Bat in the sentry hole on the first floor of Cragtooth Warren: one Volley caught three of them at once. Whenever it looked bad,…"},{"t":"Cards for Katie, read by Allie","at":"camp in The King's Road","h":["h4","h16"],"x":"Allie reads the Good Dog Tarot for Katie on a folded cloak: the Five of Cups, the Seven of Wands and the Seven of Swords upside down. Allie says it could go either way.","k":"reading","id":"r21","d":21,"s":1,"sd":21,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Toasted Cheese Trenchers","at":"the Ashveil Crypts","h":["h18"],"x":"A quiet night in the Ashveil Crypts. Morgan cooks Toasted Cheese Trenchers, eats them slowly and watches the sparks go up. They bubble brown at the corners.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m23","d":21,"s":1,"sd":21,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Heron Ford","at":"the road between The Greenwood and Thornwall","h":["h7"],"x":"Corrine crosses the Heron Ford slowly, because the water is clear enough to show exactly how deep it is.","k":"road","id":"r20","d":21,"s":1,"sd":21,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Heron Ford","at":"the road between The Greenwood and Thornwall","h":["h7"],"x":"Corrine reaches the Heron Ford and finds the heron on its usual stone, as still as a carving and twice as smug.","k":"road","id":"r21","d":21,"s":1,"sd":21,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Met Brother Aldo","at":"the road between Ashfen and The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h18"],"x":"Brother Aldo tells Morgan he has been to forty shrines this year, and names every one of them, slowly.","k":"road","id":"r13","d":20,"s":1,"sd":20,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Perch, 29 cm","at":"the Thornwall millpond","h":["h7"],"x":"The books show no Perch until today, when Corrine lands one at the Thornwall millpond.","k":"catch","id":"c3","d":20,"s":1,"sd":20,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"the Mile-Warden's hut","at":"the road between Ironhaven and Thornwall","h":["h7"],"x":"Corrine reports a fallen sign on the road to Thornwall to Sergeant Pellam at the Mile-Warden's hut. The sergeant thanks her and promises it will be fixed by the weekend, a promise Corrine chooses to…","k":"road","id":"r15","d":20,"s":1,"sd":20,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Fireside Flatbread","at":"Frostspire","h":["h15"],"x":"Alone in Frostspire, Matt tries a Fireside Flatbread and finds out why people cook it in company: someone has to stop you.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m21","d":20,"s":1,"sd":20,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Shrine of Quiet Names","at":"the road between Ashfen and The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h18"],"x":"Morgan leaves 1 copper beside a row of stubs at the Shrine of Quiet Names and lights one more.","k":"road","id":"r14","d":20,"s":1,"sd":20,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Mile-Warden's hut","at":"the road between Ironhaven and Thornwall","h":["h7"],"x":"Sergeant Pellam gives Corrine the road report at the Mile-Warden's hut: three potholes, one bandit rumoured and a very rude goose.","k":"road","id":"r16","d":20,"s":1,"sd":20,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"On the road","at":"the road between Ashfen and The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia finds a small page in the king's livery wandering the road to the Ashveil Crypts, quite lost. Olivia walks the page to the right road, and the page swears to put in a word.","k":"road","id":"r17","d":20,"s":1,"sd":20,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Shrine of Quiet Names","at":"the road between Ashfen and The Ashveil Crypts","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Olivia drops 1 copper in the dish at the Shrine of Quiet Names and lights a taper for the dead of Ashfen.","k":"road","id":"r18","d":20,"s":1,"sd":20,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Lakeside Lamprey","at":"the road between The King's Road and Thornwall","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Allie sits on the porch of the Lakeside Lamprey with a borrowed line and gets one bite and a lot of advice.","k":"road","id":"r19","d":20,"s":1,"sd":20,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Met the Lantern Lady of Gallows Cross","at":"the road between Ironhaven and Thornwall","h":["h7"],"x":"'Which road do you mean to take?' asks the Lantern Lady of Gallows Cross. She draws a card from nowhere and turns it face up for Corrine to read.","k":"road","id":"r11","d":19,"s":1,"sd":19,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Met Marigold","at":"the road between Hollowood and Thornwall","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Marigold sets up the pot for supper. Katie is given the spoon to hold, and the smell makes the miles ahead seem short.","k":"road","id":"r7","d":19,"s":1,"sd":19,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Met Ines","at":"the road between Ashfen and Carrbridge","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Ines has drawn a road that does not exist, and is thrilled by it. Ryan gently points out the hedge where it should be.","k":"road","id":"r8","d":19,"s":1,"sd":19,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Wolf Stew","at":"the Wolf Den","h":["h5","h17","h8"],"x":"Supper in the Wolf Den is some Wolf Stew. Griffin pretends not to watch everyone's faces. It is wolf, which nobody mentions to the horses.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m17","d":19,"s":1,"sd":19,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Andrew teaches Cade checkers at camp in Cragtooth Warren, which is a mistake:…","h":["h13","h2"],"k":"night","id":"n12","d":19,"s":1,"sd":19,"imp":1,"score":10,"x":"Andrew teaches Cade checkers at camp in Cragtooth Warren, which is a mistake: Cade wins the very first game."},{"t":"the Last Dry Sock","at":"the road between Cragtooth Warren and Ironhaven","h":["h11","h13","h2","h9"],"x":"The Last Dry Sock's stew has a name, a reputation and a regular complaint. Keenan buys a bowl for 1 silver and finds the complaint is justified and the stew excellent.","k":"road","id":"r10","d":19,"s":1,"sd":19,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Leaning Mile","at":"the road between Ashfen and Carrbridge","h":["h18"],"x":"Morgan finds a clear patch on the back of the Leaning Mile and carves a name there, small and straight against the lean.","k":"road","id":"r12","d":19,"s":1,"sd":19,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"the Leaning Mile","at":"the road between Ashfen and Carrbridge","h":["h10","h14","h3"],"x":"Ryan reads the distances on the Leaning Mile and gets a different sum each way. The stone has leaned so far that it counts from the side.","k":"road","id":"r9","d":19,"s":1,"sd":19,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Golden Carp, 47 cm","at":"by a stream on the road to Thornwall","h":["h16","h4"],"x":"Katie lands a Golden Carp by a stream on the road to Thornwall, the first the league has ever seen. The anglers will want to hear about it.","k":"catch","id":"c1","d":18,"s":1,"sd":18,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Cards for Mark, read by Sabine Venn","at":"the toll-house parlour","h":["h14"],"x":"Sabine Venn lays three cards out for Mark at the toll-house parlour: the Six of Swords, the Ten of Cups and the Two of Swords. Sabine Venn says it could go either way.","k":"reading","id":"r6","d":18,"s":1,"sd":18,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Troll Haunch","h":["h13"],"x":"Cade has a Troll Haunch at The Gilded Flagon and sends compliments to Madame Ostrava. It has to be carved faster than it heals. (2 silver 7 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m13","d":18,"s":1,"sd":18,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Trail Porridge with Honey","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h1","h12"],"x":"Harry stirs, tastes, frowns, adds salt in Cragtooth Warren, and serves some Trail Porridge with Honey. It tastes like a promise that tomorrow will happen.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m14","d":18,"s":1,"sd":18,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"A first game of checkers at The Gilded Flagon: Keenan wins, Andrew sulks for…","h":["h9","h2"],"k":"night","id":"n11","d":18,"s":1,"sd":18,"imp":1,"score":10,"x":"A first game of checkers at The Gilded Flagon: Keenan wins, Andrew sulks for nearly a minute, and they set the pieces up again."},{"t":"Ryan loses a first game of chess to Mark at camp by the road to Ashfen, and…","h":["h14","h3"],"k":"night","id":"n9","d":18,"s":1,"sd":18,"imp":1,"score":10,"x":"Ryan loses a first game of chess to Mark at camp by the road to Ashfen, and asks for the best of three. Then the best of five."},{"t":"Cards for Morgan, read by Sabine Venn","at":"the toll-house parlour","h":["h18"],"x":"At the toll-house parlour, Sabine Venn turns Morgan's three cards one at a time: the Five of Pentacles upside down, the Queen of Cups and the Sun. A good spread, all told.","k":"reading","id":"r4","d":17,"s":1,"sd":17,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Thornwall Meat Pie","at":"judging the Thornwall cooks' feud","h":["h18"],"x":"Morgan is cornered by Goodwife Pell of the guild bakehouse and Corporal Hobb of the barracks kitchen in Thornwall and made to taste both. Corporal Hobb of the barracks kitchen wins, and Goodwife…","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m10","d":17,"s":1,"sd":17,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Kobold Peppercorn Stew","h":["h18"],"x":"Jolly Mott talks Morgan into some Kobold Peppercorn Stew at The Honest Toll. Good advice: it is eaten slowly and with respect. (2 silver 1 copper)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m11","d":17,"s":1,"sd":17,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Ration-Bag Hash","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h1","h12"],"x":"Harry's Ration-Bag Hash in Cragtooth Warren goes wrong somewhere between the pot and the plate. Nobody can say where, but everyone can say when.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m12","d":17,"s":1,"sd":17,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Corrine's first reading, from Aunt Crumb at the back of the pie shop: three…","h":["h7"],"k":"reading","id":"r5","d":17,"s":1,"sd":17,"imp":1,"score":10,"x":"Corrine's first reading, from Aunt Crumb at the back of the pie shop: three cards, and Aunt Crumb taps the Lovers twice."},{"t":"The Sergeant's Roast","h":["h17"],"x":"Old Hesk has written The Sergeant's Roast on the board at The Sagging Beam in letters a foot high: dish of the week. Amanda orders it before sitting down. It is carved at attention. (3 silver)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m5","d":16,"s":1,"sd":16,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Smoked Ice-Lake Salmon","at":"the Frosthold feast-day tables","h":["h15"],"x":"Feast day in Frosthold: Matt finds a bench at the long tables and eats some Smoked Ice-Lake Salmon with strangers who are friends by the pudding. It tastes of birch smoke and a cold clear lake. (8…","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m7","d":16,"s":1,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Forge-Bellows Pepper Pot","h":["h14"],"x":"Madame Ostrava has written Forge-Bellows Pepper Pot on the board at The Gilded Flagon in letters a foot high: dish of the week. Mark orders it before sitting down. It has a ladle that has never been…","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m8","d":16,"s":1,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Twist-Bread on a Stick","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h1","h12"],"x":"Harry tries some Twist-Bread on a Stick in Cragtooth Warren. It goes wrong in a way nobody can quite explain, and everyone is a little unwell by morning.","tag":"camp","k":"meal","id":"m9","d":16,"s":1,"sd":16,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"Cards for Matt, read by Grandmother Skaldi","at":"a hut at the edge of the snowfield","h":["h15"],"x":"Grandmother Skaldi lays three cards out for Matt at a hut at the edge of the snowfield: the Ten of Pentacles, the Ace of Pentacles and the Knight of Swords. The cards are kind.","k":"reading","id":"r1","d":15,"s":1,"sd":15,"imp":2,"score":20},{"t":"Sabine Venn lays out Harry's first spread at the toll-house parlour. \"The Ten…","h":["h1"],"k":"reading","id":"r2","d":15,"s":1,"sd":15,"imp":2,"score":20,"x":"Sabine Venn lays out Harry's first spread at the toll-house parlour. \"The Ten of Swords upside down,\" Sabine Venn says, and lets it sit there."},{"t":"Tidal Riders vs Gruk the Warchief, a Goblin Shaman and a Goblin","r":"won","at":"Goblin Camp","h":["h17","h8","h5"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f41","d":14,"s":1,"sd":14,"imp":5,"score":173,"x":"At the bottom of Goblin Camp, Tidal Riders slay Gruk the Warchief, a Goblin Shaman and a Goblin. Amanda found the weak spot first and kept hitting it; without Griffin's Battle Cry, this goes…"},{"t":"The Royal Shadows vs 3 Kobolds","r":"won","at":"Cragtooth Warren","h":["h9","h13","h11","h2"],"tag":"camp","k":"fight","id":"f46","d":14,"s":1,"sd":14,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"In the middle of the night, The Royal Shadows make short work of 3 Kobolds at their camp in Cragtooth Warren. Cade kept a cool head while everyone else was shouting, and Andrew and Socks the dog…"},{"t":"Gruk's Victory Ham","at":"Goblin Camp","h":["h5","h17","h8"],"x":"Griffin cooks Gruk's Victory Ham in Goblin Camp, from the spoils. Nobody says a word until it's gone. It is the best thing Gruk ever owned. They'll talk about it for years.","tag":"legendary","k":"meal","id":"m2","d":14,"s":1,"sd":14,"imp":3,"score":30},{"t":"Spice-Barge Pilaf","h":["h4"],"x":"Allie has some Spice-Barge Pilaf at The Honest Toll and sends compliments to Jolly Mott. It has a raisin in every third mouthful, by tradition. (2 silver)","tag":"tavern","k":"meal","id":"m1","d":14,"s":1,"sd":14,"imp":1,"score":10},{"t":"The Royal Shadows vs 2 Bandit Archers, a Bandit Captain and a Bandit","r":"won","at":"The King's Road","h":["h9","h13","h11","h2"],"tag":"road","k":"fight","id":"f39","d":13,"s":1,"sd":13,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"The Royal Shadows handle 2 Bandit Archers, a Bandit Captain and a Bandit on the road to Cragtooth Warren. Whenever it looked bad, Andrew was already there. Joshua picked the biggest one and did not…"},{"t":"Morgan vs a Bandit","r":"won","at":"The Greenwood","h":["h18"],"tag":"road","k":"fight","id":"f35","d":12,"s":1,"sd":12,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"First blood for Morgan: Morgan sees off a Bandit on the road to the Greenwood. Loot: 3 rations."},{"t":"Matt vs the Silk Matriarch","r":"won","at":"The Collapsed Mine","h":["h15"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f29","d":11,"s":1,"sd":11,"imp":5,"score":137,"x":"Matt slays the Silk Matriarch at the bottom of the Collapsed Mine. Loot: 11 chitin."},{"t":"Tidal Riders vs 4 Goblins and a Giant Rat","r":"won","at":"Goblin Camp","h":["h17","h8","h5"],"tag":"dungeon","k":"fight","id":"f31","d":11,"s":1,"sd":11,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"First blood for Amanda and Griffin: Tidal Riders handle 4 Goblins and a Giant Rat on floor 1 of Goblin Camp. Whenever it looked bad, Amanda was already there. Loot: 5 goblin ears."},{"t":"The Royal Shadows vs 5 Wolves","r":"won","at":"The King's Road","h":["h9","h13","h11","h2"],"k":"fight","id":"f24","d":9,"s":1,"sd":9,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"The Royal Shadows defeat 5 Wolves on the King's Road, with Cade calling out every flank before it turned. Loot: 3 pelts, 3 fangs & claws."},{"t":"The Green Hammers vs a Drake, a Cliff Crab and a Bandit","r":"won","at":"The Salt Cliffs","h":["h1","h12"],"k":"fight","id":"f17","d":8,"s":1,"sd":8,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"First blood for Harry: The Green Hammers beat a Drake, a Cliff Crab and a Bandit on the road to the Salt Cliffs, and Harry went in first without waiting to be asked. Jeff is already telling it as…"},{"t":"The Pack of Carrbridge vs a Bandit Captain, a Wolf and a Bandit Archer","r":"won","at":"The King's Road","h":["h4","h16"],"k":"fight","id":"f20","d":8,"s":1,"sd":8,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"First blood for Allie and Katie: The Pack of Carrbridge routs a Bandit Captain, a Wolf and a Bandit Archer on the King's Road and comes away with 6 stolen goods and 1 fang."},{"t":"The Black Pack vs 2 Bandits","r":"won","at":"The King's Road","h":["h14","h3","h10"],"k":"fight","id":"f21","d":8,"s":1,"sd":8,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"First blood for Mark, Ryan and Olivia: The Black Pack sees off 2 Bandits on the King's Road. Loot: 4 stolen goods, 1 ration, 1 trinket."},{"t":"Tidal Riders vs 2 Bandit Captains","r":"lost","at":"The King's Road","h":["h17","h8"],"k":"fight","id":"f16","d":6,"s":1,"sd":6,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"Two Bandit Captains rout the Tidal Riders on the King's Road, and Amanda and Troy beat a hasty retreat. \"Run! Why aren't we running?\" Troy asks, already running."},{"t":"The Royal Shadows vs a Wolf, a Bandit Archer and a Bandit","r":"won","at":"The King's Road","h":["h9","h13","h11"],"k":"fight","id":"f11","d":4,"s":1,"sd":4,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"First blood for Keenan: The Royal Shadows see off a Wolf, a Bandit Archer and a Bandit on the King's Road. Joshua did the unglamorous work that kept the line from breaking. Loot: 1 fang, 2 stolen…"},{"t":"Jeff vs a Bandit","r":"won","at":"The King's Road","h":["h12"],"k":"fight","id":"f13","d":4,"s":1,"sd":4,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"First blood for Jeff: one Bandit, beaten on the road to Veldrock. The spoils: 1 ration."},{"t":"Joshua vs Mother Mire","r":"lost","at":"The King's Road","h":["h11"],"k":"fight","id":"f8","d":3,"s":1,"sd":3,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"Mother Mire overwhelms Joshua on the King's Road. He comes away with a broken leg."},{"t":"Troy vs a Wolf","r":"won","at":"The King's Road","h":["h8"],"k":"fight","id":"f3","d":2,"s":1,"sd":2,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"First blood for Troy: he sees off a Wolf on the road to Thornwall and walks away with 1 pelt and 2 fangs & claws."},{"t":"Andrew vs a Bandit Archer and a Bandit","r":"won","at":"The King's Road","h":["h2"],"k":"fight","id":"f4","d":2,"s":1,"sd":2,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"First blood for Andrew, on the King's Road: a Bandit Archer and a Bandit go down, and he comes away with 1 bag of stolen goods."},{"t":"Matt vs a Giant Rat and a Kobold","r":"won","at":"The Collapsed Mine","h":["h15"],"k":"fight","id":"f5","d":2,"s":1,"sd":2,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"First blood for Matt, on floor 1 of the Collapsed Mine: a Giant Rat and a Kobold, dispatched. The haul: 1 fang and 1 trinket."},{"t":"Cade vs a Bandit Archer","r":"won","at":"The King's Road","h":["h13"],"k":"fight","id":"f6","d":2,"s":1,"sd":2,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"First blood for Cade: he makes short work of a Bandit Archer on the road to Ironhaven and pockets 1 bag of stolen goods."},{"t":"Keenan vs a Bandit Captain","r":"lost","at":"The King's Road","h":["h9"],"k":"fight","id":"f7","d":2,"s":1,"sd":2,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"A Bandit Captain catches Keenan on the road to Ironhaven, and Keenan does the sensible thing: he runs for it."},{"t":"Mark vs a Bandit Captain and a Wolf","r":"lost","at":"The King's Road","h":["h14"],"k":"fight","id":"f1","d":1,"s":1,"sd":1,"imp":3,"score":30,"x":"A rough start on the road to Veldrock: a Bandit Captain and a Wolf overwhelm Mark, who limps off with a cracked collarbone."}]};